(1099592, 134605, 29797, '<td valign="top">Great idea, excellent composition. Pretty scary too, thanks for the nightmares! 10</td>', 'Great idea, excellent composition. Pretty scary too, thanks for the nightmares! 10', '2005-01-10 09:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099601, 133849, 15204, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is beautiful in this shot.  I think showing a little more of the leaves would improve the composition. - 6</td>', 'The bokeh is beautiful in this shot.  I think showing a little more of the leaves would improve the composition. - 6', '2005-01-10 09:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099611, 134718, 29797, '<td valign="top">I think I need to re-calibrate my monitor... those look more salmon color than red on my screen. Nice shot though.      ...If you didn''t have that candle in front, I would think the farther one was something else.  ;)</td>', 'I think I need to re-calibrate my monitor... those look more salmon color than red on my screen. Nice shot though.      ...If you didn''t have that candle in front, I would think the farther one was something else.  ;)', '2005-01-10 09:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099619, 134803, 19828, '<td valign="top">This is really wonderful!<br/>I hadn''t been voting up to this point, but this inspired me to vote.<br/>Although you might lose points for not fitting the challenge rules to a tee... I really like it!<br/>I love the title and the image is just plain eerie.<br/>I gave you a 10.<br/></td>', 'This is really wonderful!I hadn''t been voting up to this point, but this inspired me to vote.Although you might lose points for not fitting the challenge rules to a tee... I really like it!I love the title and the image is just plain eerie.I gave you a 10.', '2005-01-10 09:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099621, 134559, 19828, '<td valign="top">I love cats.<br/>Therefore you will receive a high vote from me on this entry.<br/>Maybe I am biased... but who cares if you profit from that bias!<br/>9</td>', 'I love cats.Therefore you will receive a high vote from me on this entry.Maybe I am biased... but who cares if you profit from that bias!9', '2005-01-10 09:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
