(1099648, 134767, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." To me this does not fit the challenge.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." To me this does not fit the challenge.', '2005-01-10 10:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099649, 134783, 19828, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this one!<br/>Good work!<br/>8</td>', 'I love the colors in this one!Good work!8', '2005-01-10 10:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099651, 134632, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? For this particular image I''d say no. The desaturation of the subject makes this a more interesting shot.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? For this particular image I''d say no. The desaturation of the subject makes this a more interesting shot.', '2005-01-10 10:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099652, 134338, 19828, '<td valign="top">Great Title!<br/>Great shot as well.<br/>8</td>', 'Great Title!Great shot as well.8', '2005-01-10 10:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099653, 134734, 19828, '<td valign="top">What a good boy!<br/>Give him a pet for me!<br/>Perfect color matching!<br/>9</td>', 'What a good boy!Give him a pet for me!Perfect color matching!9', '2005-01-10 10:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099654, 134563, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. The bokeh here is smooth and subtly varied, makes for a very calm and attractive image. Nicely done.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. The bokeh here is smooth and subtly varied, makes for a very calm and attractive image. Nicely done.', '2005-01-10 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099655, 134458, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yep. The only thing odd to me here is that all the bokeh is behind the reindeer. The composition kind of makes it looks like it''s all come out the reindeer''s backside, and he''s making some noise about it!!</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yep. The only thing odd to me here is that all the bokeh is behind the reindeer. The composition kind of makes it looks like it''s all come out the reindeer''s backside, and he''s making some noise about it!!', '2005-01-10 10:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099656, 134646, 19828, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!<br/>8</td>', 'Wonderful!8', '2005-01-10 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1);
