(1099883, 134736, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely perfect. the look on the face is really cool - plus great image for this challenge theme - plus, love the monochromatic tones - contrast - everything is pitch perfect. I hope you win the blue ribbon - 10</td>', 'This is absolutely perfect. the look on the face is really cool - plus great image for this challenge theme - plus, love the monochromatic tones - contrast - everything is pitch perfect. I hope you win the blue ribbon - 10', '2005-01-10 12:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
