(1099895, 134679, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot but don''t know that the blurred areas of the image add that much impact for me or wow me with their aesthetic. Certainly I do think that the shallow DOF background works well for the image and I also like the little bit of detail and reflection on the container but - the shapes and colours of the background don''t thrill me. There''s also something weird about the luminous nature of the dandelion head - something about the lighting perhaps that looks odd to me. I voted this a 6.</td>', 'I like this image a lot but don''t know that the blurred areas of the image add that much impact for me or wow me with their aesthetic. Certainly I do think that the shallow DOF background works well for the image and I also like the little bit of detail and reflection on the container but - the shapes and colours of the background don''t thrill me. There''s also something weird about the luminous nature of the dandelion head - something about the lighting perhaps that looks odd to me. I voted this a 6.', '2005-01-10 12:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099896, 133344, 31408, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the antenna being cropped out of frame. Maybe a differnt shooting angle could have left it in?</td>', 'I don''t care for the antenna being cropped out of frame. Maybe a differnt shooting angle could have left it in?', '2005-01-10 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
