(1099898, 134459, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is  very nice image <br/>but unfortuinality i feel that the DoF isn''t as shallow as it needs to be for boken affect too be seen.<br/>putting the cam. into macro mode(or having shot w/macro lens) would have helped</td>', 'this is  very nice image but unfortuinality i feel that the DoF isn''t as shallow as it needs to be for boken affect too be seen.putting the cam. into macro mode(or having shot w/macro lens) would have helped', '2005-01-10 12:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099899, 134679, 30861, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of bokeh to this, just a cluster of them near the bottom. Strange, eerie colors. Effective frame. As an aside, I''d question whether this dandelion is really "dormant", but that''s neither here nor there. Nicely composed and lit.</td>', 'Not a lot of bokeh to this, just a cluster of them near the bottom. Strange, eerie colors. Effective frame. As an aside, I''d question whether this dandelion is really "dormant", but that''s neither here nor there. Nicely composed and lit.', '2005-01-10 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099901, 134705, 16636, '<td valign="top">if the sharpness was there, this would have been a very good image - good luck</td>', 'if the sharpness was there, this would have been a very good image - good luck', '2005-01-10 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099903, 134783, 3569, '<td valign="top">colors are quite nice</td>', 'colors are quite nice', '2005-01-10 12:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099904, 133762, 31408, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, makes me wish for warmer days...</td>', 'Very pretty, makes me wish for warmer days...', '2005-01-10 12:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099906, 134510, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the pattern of the bokeh area on this and the way it sits in a zig zag area between the leaf edges. The abstract pattern of the colours and shapes in that background are quite fascinating. What lets this down for me is the lighting on those leaves - too much shadow for my tastes. If the leaf on the left were lit to show colour as the ones on the right show I think it would balance the composition more strongly. Overall I find the colours a touch too muted though perhaps if there weren''t so much shadow that would not be an issue. I voted this a 6.</td>', 'I really like the pattern of the bokeh area on this and the way it sits in a zig zag area between the leaf edges. The abstract pattern of the colours and shapes in that background are quite fascinating. What lets this down for me is the lighting on those leaves - too much shadow for my tastes. If the leaf on the left were lit to show colour as the ones on the right show I think it would balance the composition more strongly. Overall I find the colours a touch too muted though perhaps if there weren''t so much shadow that would not be an issue. I voted this a 6.', '2005-01-10 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099908, 133219, 30861, '<td valign="top">Adorable puppy, cute pic, sense of bokeh int he far BG, but the birdbath (?) separates the bokeh from the subject and makes it less effectiuve as a relationship between the 2 layers, which is what I am looking for.</td>', 'Adorable puppy, cute pic, sense of bokeh int he far BG, but the birdbath (?) separates the bokeh from the subject and makes it less effectiuve as a relationship between the 2 layers, which is what I am looking for.', '2005-01-10 12:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099909, 134485, 31408, '<td valign="top">EExcellent image. I would rather see a slightly greater DOF on the shaft and/or more detail of the end in focus now.</td>', 'EExcellent image. I would rather see a slightly greater DOF on the shaft and/or more detail of the end in focus now.', '2005-01-10 12:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099910, 134732, 31408, '<td valign="top">Simple and soft - I like it.</td>', 'Simple and soft - I like it.', '2005-01-10 12:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099912, 134146, 31408, '<td valign="top">I like itbut Id rather see better exposure of the bottle, its a tad dark.</td>', 'I like itbut Id rather see better exposure of the bottle, its a tad dark.', '2005-01-10 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099914, 134485, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think the idea on this is great! - The colours and shapes in the out of focus area are absolutely key to communicating what it is that we are looking at. There are a few reasons this doesn''t score highly with me though and they are generally down to personal taste, though that''s the case for all my votes! Firstly I just don''t like the luminous colours on this board. I wonder if a traditionally coloured darts board might have appealed to me more? Secondly I am not hugely keen on the centred composition though it is nicely done. Thirdly I feel that the key part of the dart is the pointed tip not the flight so I''m not so keen on having that part of the dart fall into the out of focus area. <br/>I scored this a 5.</td>', 'I think the idea on this is great! - The colours and shapes in the out of focus area are absolutely key to communicating what it is that we are looking at. There are a few reasons this doesn''t score highly with me though and they are generally down to personal taste, though that''s the case for all my votes! Firstly I just don''t like the luminous colours on this board. I wonder if a traditionally coloured darts board might have appealed to me more? Secondly I am not hugely keen on the centred composition though it is nicely done. Thirdly I feel that the key part of the dart is the pointed tip not the flight so I''m not so keen on having that part of the dart fall into the out of focus area. I scored this a 5.', '2005-01-10 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099915, 134704, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely divine. I hoep you win a ribbon for this. It''s perfect in every way. Love the way the feathers look, the detail and the expression. 10</td>', 'This is absolutely divine. I hoep you win a ribbon for this. It''s perfect in every way. Love the way the feathers look, the detail and the expression. 10', '2005-01-10 12:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099916, 133629, 31408, '<td valign="top">Very sweet concept...</td>', 'Very sweet concept...', '2005-01-10 12:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099918, 134604, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Boy do we see that here! Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background?  In every sense of the word. I think it''s fabulous that the bokeh almost has a grid patterm, I''ve never seen anything like that before- can''t wait to find out after the challenge what camera and lens you used. Nice job!!</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Boy do we see that here! Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background?  In every sense of the word. I think it''s fabulous that the bokeh almost has a grid patterm, I''ve never seen anything like that before- can''t wait to find out after the challenge what camera and lens you used. Nice job!!', '2005-01-10 12:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099919, 133927, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We do see that here, though its much more just out of focus background. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Even still, I don''t find that this shot grabs or inspires me.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We do see that here, though its much more just out of focus background. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Even still, I don''t find that this shot grabs or inspires me.', '2005-01-10 12:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1099920, 134760, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yep. But from a creative, aesthetic standpoint I don''t find this shot inspiring.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yep. But from a creative, aesthetic standpoint I don''t find this shot inspiring.', '2005-01-10 12:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
