(1099922, 133443, 10658, '<td valign="top">The bokeh here is great, no question about that.  However, the flower seems to be most in focus around the leaves rather than the bloom, personally I''d prefer the bloom to be sharper.</td>', 'The bokeh here is great, no question about that.  However, the flower seems to be most in focus around the leaves rather than the bloom, personally I''d prefer the bloom to be sharper.', '2005-01-10 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
