(1099950, 134573, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We do see that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? The combination of flowers and berries do make for a colorful image, but to my eye the frame looks crammed full and contrived. I''d prefer to see more simplicity. So in that respect, I don''t feel that any element here enhances another, they just distract from one another.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We do see that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? The combination of flowers and berries do make for a colorful image, but to my eye the frame looks crammed full and contrived. I''d prefer to see more simplicity. So in that respect, I don''t feel that any element here enhances another, they just distract from one another.', '2005-01-10 12:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
