(1100046, 133891, 25017, '<td valign="top">this is awesome if you turn your head to the side I can see an apes face almost :) maybe an orangutang, what a great emotional feel to the whole picture just wish I could put my finger on what is not quite right with the depth of colour, but saying that I know from experience people see different shades depending on their monitor a good (7)</td>', 'this is awesome if you turn your head to the side I can see an apes face almost :) maybe an orangutang, what a great emotional feel to the whole picture just wish I could put my finger on what is not quite right with the depth of colour, but saying that I know from experience people see different shades depending on their monitor a good (7)', '2005-01-10 13:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100050, 134508, 31213, '<td valign="top">Your bokeh in this image is rather nice.  The problem lies with your subject.  If your focal point is the shotglass, then you should have composed it so that it wasn''t dead center in your shot.  If the focal point was meant to be the bottle, then you should have moved the vodka bottle further back (as to not be distracting) and probably done something else with the shot glasses cause they draw the attention away from the bottle.  The background is nice....not distracting.</td>', 'Your bokeh in this image is rather nice.  The problem lies with your subject.  If your focal point is the shotglass, then you should have composed it so that it wasn''t dead center in your shot.  If the focal point was meant to be the bottle, then you should have moved the vodka bottle further back (as to not be distracting) and probably done something else with the shot glasses cause they draw the attention away from the bottle.  The background is nice....not distracting.', '2005-01-10 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
