(1100053, 134133, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. A very nice image, though on my monitor (recently calibrated) there is some artifacting on the left side where it goes to a darker gray. Also, the patterns in your points of light are somewhat distracting, but that''s not your fault ;)</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. A very nice image, though on my monitor (recently calibrated) there is some artifacting on the left side where it goes to a darker gray. Also, the patterns in your points of light are somewhat distracting, but that''s not your fault ;)', '2005-01-10 13:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100054, 134701, 31213, '<td valign="top">This picture has a shallow depth of field, but no bokeh.  The out of focus background doesnt enhance your subject in any way.  Also the post itself looks a little grainy with quite a bit of noise.  Best part about the picture is the lighting....probably taken in the late afternoon sun.  Nice job.</td>', 'This picture has a shallow depth of field, but no bokeh.  The out of focus background doesnt enhance your subject in any way.  Also the post itself looks a little grainy with quite a bit of noise.  Best part about the picture is the lighting....probably taken in the late afternoon sun.  Nice job.', '2005-01-10 13:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100055, 134459, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Not really seeing that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? In my mind this doesn''t fit the challenge. Nice photo, though seems to be a bit overexposed.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Not really seeing that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? In my mind this doesn''t fit the challenge. Nice photo, though seems to be a bit overexposed.', '2005-01-10 13:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100056, 134301, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Very nice photo.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Very nice photo.', '2005-01-10 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100057, 133079, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We have that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. However the centered composition and somewhat harsh light detract from this photo.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We have that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. However the centered composition and somewhat harsh light detract from this photo.', '2005-01-10 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100058, 134814, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We have bokeh.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. However, this photo doesn''t grab or inspire me.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We have bokeh.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. However, this photo doesn''t grab or inspire me.', '2005-01-10 13:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100059, 134770, 31213, '<td valign="top">This is simply a shallow DOF.  I dont think this is a great representation of bokeh.  Maybe if the shaped of the out of focus background enhanced your subject, or the colors of the background helped your sebject stand out, but I almost think he gets lost int he similar colors behind him.  Love the subject though!</td>', 'This is simply a shallow DOF.  I dont think this is a great representation of bokeh.  Maybe if the shaped of the out of focus background enhanced your subject, or the colors of the background helped your sebject stand out, but I almost think he gets lost int he similar colors behind him.  Love the subject though!', '2005-01-10 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100061, 134491, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice Bokeh. Definately fits the challenge.</td>', 'Nice Bokeh. Definately fits the challenge.', '2005-01-10 13:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100063, 134789, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Fits the challenge.  Nice bokeh.  Not many people pulled it off.</td>', 'Nice job!  Fits the challenge.  Nice bokeh.  Not many people pulled it off.', '2005-01-10 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100064, 134352, 31408, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but zoo shots cab be tough to pull off and this one doesn''t quite get there imo.  Seeing hints of captivity (nail, wire, painted background) in the image really detracts from the over all impact. Also I''m not certain the bkgd blur rises to the level of bokeh.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but zoo shots cab be tough to pull off and this one doesn''t quite get there imo.  Seeing hints of captivity (nail, wire, painted background) in the image really detracts from the over all impact. Also I''m not certain the bkgd blur rises to the level of bokeh.', '2005-01-10 13:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100065, 134630, 31213, '<td valign="top">Doesnt fit the challenge.  A post production blur is not bokeh.</td>', 'Doesnt fit the challenge.  A post production blur is not bokeh.', '2005-01-10 13:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100066, 134781, 31408, '<td valign="top">Pretty and sparkly!</td>', 'Pretty and sparkly!', '2005-01-10 13:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100067, 134476, 31408, '<td valign="top">Good shot, if a bit dark - nice overall composition....</td>', 'Good shot, if a bit dark - nice overall composition....', '2005-01-10 13:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100068, 134605, 27137, '<td valign="top">cool, ive seen loads of photos with chess pices, this one  represents the game nicely</td>', 'cool, ive seen loads of photos with chess pices, this one  represents the game nicely', '2005-01-10 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100069, 134590, 31213, '<td valign="top">There is absolutely 100% no bokeh in this picture!  Nice shot, but not apropriate.  If you had capture these flowers in a garden with out of focus shapes in the background to enhance your subject, it could have worked.</td>', 'There is absolutely 100% no bokeh in this picture!  Nice shot, but not apropriate.  If you had capture these flowers in a garden with out of focus shapes in the background to enhance your subject, it could have worked.', '2005-01-10 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100070, 134758, 14735, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been even better if you got rid of the people and the bench in the background or even cropped them out. NIce photo otherwise.</td>', 'I think this would have been even better if you got rid of the people and the bench in the background or even cropped them out. NIce photo otherwise.', '2005-01-10 13:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100072, 133812, 31408, '<td valign="top">Well thought-out shot, I love the sparse presence of the red and yellow colors. The bokeh is a bit bland, but the shot is nice on it''s own.</td>', 'Well thought-out shot, I love the sparse presence of the red and yellow colors. The bokeh is a bit bland, but the shot is nice on it''s own.', '2005-01-10 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100073, 134608, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh but lacks creativity.  This seems like a last minute desparate entry to me!  You have the right idea with the bokeh, but I wish you had put a little more thought into the subject.  A small wooden man dead center in the frame shows poor compositional skills and creativity.  I know you can do better than that!</td>', 'Nice bokeh but lacks creativity.  This seems like a last minute desparate entry to me!  You have the right idea with the bokeh, but I wish you had put a little more thought into the subject.  A small wooden man dead center in the frame shows poor compositional skills and creativity.  I know you can do better than that!', '2005-01-10 13:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100075, 134172, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Definitely. We have a winner.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Definitely. We have a winner.', '2005-01-10 13:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100076, 134461, 31408, '<td valign="top">Not as sharp as I would like - you really have to do something special with flowers (so commonly chosen).</td>', 'Not as sharp as I would like - you really have to do something special with flowers (so commonly chosen).', '2005-01-10 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100079, 134310, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Sorta have that here.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Not really. Can''t tell what it is. Doesn''t inspire or grab me.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Sorta have that here.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Not really. Can''t tell what it is. Doesn''t inspire or grab me.', '2005-01-10 13:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100080, 134693, 14735, '<td valign="top">I hope this is doing well for you.  It is a beautiful photo but I know some people may not like that the background is not that out of focus.  The color and shadow work well here.</td>', 'I hope this is doing well for you.  It is a beautiful photo but I know some people may not like that the background is not that out of focus.  The color and shadow work well here.', '2005-01-10 13:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100081, 133846, 31408, '<td valign="top">Great shot, interesting bokeh and sharp focus on the branches.</td>', 'Great shot, interesting bokeh and sharp focus on the branches.', '2005-01-10 13:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100082, 134508, 31408, '<td valign="top">Too busy because the background isn''t as out of focus as possible (imo).</td>', 'Too busy because the background isn''t as out of focus as possible (imo).', '2005-01-10 13:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100083, 134695, 31408, '<td valign="top">Good shot, needle shart...nice background blur.</td>', 'Good shot, needle shart...nice background blur.', '2005-01-10 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100084, 133746, 31408, '<td valign="top">I don''t like seeing the adhesive holding the controller up, the background is a little too bland.</td>', 'I don''t like seeing the adhesive holding the controller up, the background is a little too bland.', '2005-01-10 13:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100085, 133636, 14735, '<td valign="top">I really like when someone can take a simple object and turn it into a great photograph. I rally like this, good job.</td>', 'I really like when someone can take a simple object and turn it into a great photograph. I rally like this, good job.', '2005-01-10 13:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100086, 134546, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Definately one of the better entries.  You understand the concept and you''ve captured a redhead.  Thats worth an extra point in my opinion!  She is cute!  Daughter?  Girlfriend? Wife? Friend?  Tell her you know another great photographer she should meet.  :))</td>', 'Nice job!  Definately one of the better entries.  You understand the concept and you''ve captured a redhead.  Thats worth an extra point in my opinion!  She is cute!  Daughter?  Girlfriend? Wife? Friend?  Tell her you know another great photographer she should meet.  :))', '2005-01-10 13:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100087, 134609, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Marginal bokeh possible at the far edges of the book, but that''s reaching. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? I don''t feel this meets the challenge. And unfortunately the shot itself isn''t particularly inspiring or grabbing.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Marginal bokeh possible at the far edges of the book, but that''s reaching. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? I don''t feel this meets the challenge. And unfortunately the shot itself isn''t particularly inspiring or grabbing.', '2005-01-10 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100089, 134370, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We sorta have that, but it''s marginal.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? This is more like a shallow DOF shot than a bokeh shot. And in my mind the background definitely detracts from the foreground ;)</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We sorta have that, but it''s marginal.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? This is more like a shallow DOF shot than a bokeh shot. And in my mind the background definitely detracts from the foreground ;)', '2005-01-10 13:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100094, 133793, 31213, '<td valign="top">Ok...mixed feelings.  I liked the picture a lot at first.  After closer inspection I noticed the odd blurry hazed around even the part of the flower that should be in focus.  This could be over processing in post.  I think your blue pedal could be a little sharper focused.  Still a good shot...better tham many.</td>', 'Ok...mixed feelings.  I liked the picture a lot at first.  After closer inspection I noticed the odd blurry hazed around even the part of the flower that should be in focus.  This could be over processing in post.  I think your blue pedal could be a little sharper focused.  Still a good shot...better tham many.', '2005-01-10 13:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100095, 134588, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." In spades! Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Most certainly. And the effect on the bokeh within the bulb adds interest. Great shot.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." In spades! Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Most certainly. And the effect on the bokeh within the bulb adds interest. Great shot.', '2005-01-10 13:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100098, 134646, 14735, '<td valign="top">I wish something else was done with the nails, maybe more uniform or not there at all. The bubble is increadable and the background really works with this photo.  I still scored it high.</td>', 'I wish something else was done with the nails, maybe more uniform or not there at all. The bubble is increadable and the background really works with this photo.  I still scored it high.', '2005-01-10 13:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100099, 134546, 14735, '<td valign="top">Great angle on this one</td>', 'Great angle on this one', '2005-01-10 14:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100100, 134713, 31213, '<td valign="top">If you could have made those stars more out of focus it would have been better.  They are a little distracting from your subject the way they are.</td>', 'If you could have made those stars more out of focus it would have been better.  They are a little distracting from your subject the way they are.', '2005-01-10 14:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100101, 134675, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Very creative shot. Can''t imagine how many tries it took!</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Very creative shot. Can''t imagine how many tries it took!', '2005-01-10 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100102, 134736, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh!  You did a great job with the concept and creativity.  Excellent!</td>', 'Nice bokeh!  You did a great job with the concept and creativity.  Excellent!', '2005-01-10 14:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100103, 133414, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." In spades, and so colorful too! Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Very cute.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." In spades, and so colorful too! Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. Very cute.', '2005-01-10 14:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100105, 134563, 31213, '<td valign="top">nice close-up, but I dont see any bokeh at all!  I think people are looking for shapes and colors int he out-of-focus background that enhance your subject.  Nice shot and creative and fitting title.</td>', 'nice close-up, but I dont see any bokeh at all!  I think people are looking for shapes and colors int he out-of-focus background that enhance your subject.  Nice shot and creative and fitting title.', '2005-01-10 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100106, 134703, 14735, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. I would love after the challenge to find out what lens you used on this one.</td>', 'This is a great photo. I would love after the challenge to find out what lens you used on this one.', '2005-01-10 14:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100107, 134003, 31408, '<td valign="top">I love this shot...</td>', 'I love this shot...', '2005-01-10 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100108, 134805, 31408, '<td valign="top">Great shot, of course....</td>', 'Great shot, of course....', '2005-01-10 14:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100109, 134606, 31213, '<td valign="top">Cool pic but doesn''t fit this challenge as I''m sure you''ve noticed from looking at everyone elses pics.</td>', 'Cool pic but doesn''t fit this challenge as I''m sure you''ve noticed from looking at everyone elses pics.', '2005-01-10 14:05:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1100110, 134679, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check, Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Definitely. Well done, crabappl ;)</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check, Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Definitely. Well done, crabappl ;)', '2005-01-10 14:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100111, 134501, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." I don''t really see that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Not really. Sorry, this doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." I don''t really see that here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Not really. Sorry, this doesn''t work for me.', '2005-01-10 14:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100112, 134056, 31213, '<td valign="top">This looks obviously photoshopped to me.  Its a great shot, but once a picture becomes about the "photoshop" instead of the "content" it loses its meaning.  Nice attempt though</td>', 'This looks obviously photoshopped to me.  Its a great shot, but once a picture becomes about the "photoshop" instead of the "content" it loses its meaning.  Nice attempt though', '2005-01-10 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100113, 133040, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We see a little of that. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Sort of. This image is small, which will lower your score. Also this is more a shallow DOF shot than a bokeh shot.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We see a little of that. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Sort of. This image is small, which will lower your score. Also this is more a shallow DOF shot than a bokeh shot.', '2005-01-10 14:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100115, 134592, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice bokeh.  A lot fo people totally missed the concept....I think you got it though.</td>', 'Very nice bokeh.  A lot fo people totally missed the concept....I think you got it though.', '2005-01-10 14:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100116, 134145, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Definitely present, and so colorul. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Somewhat. This shot feels a bit contrived, and I wish there was just a little more of the guitar in focus. Nice effect on the neck though.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Definitely present, and so colorul. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Somewhat. This shot feels a bit contrived, and I wish there was just a little more of the guitar in focus. Nice effect on the neck though.', '2005-01-10 14:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100119, 133703, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.  You hit the nail on the head here.  Nice work.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.  You hit the nail on the head here.  Nice work.', '2005-01-10 14:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100120, 133388, 31213, '<td valign="top">okay, I believe you understand the bokeh idea, but in this particular shot I find it a little distracting from the subject.  Cool flower though and nice composure.</td>', 'okay, I believe you understand the bokeh idea, but in this particular shot I find it a little distracting from the subject.  Cool flower though and nice composure.', '2005-01-10 14:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100121, 134491, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Definitely. The only thing that hurts this image for me is the slight noise. Otherwise lovely.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Present. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Definitely. The only thing that hurts this image for me is the slight noise. Otherwise lovely.', '2005-01-10 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100123, 134646, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Cool bokeh and interesting idea.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Cool bokeh and interesting idea.', '2005-01-10 14:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100124, 134684, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." This doesn''t really show much in the way of bokeh. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Somewhat. Though the photo is small, which will lower your score.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." This doesn''t really show much in the way of bokeh. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Somewhat. Though the photo is small, which will lower your score.', '2005-01-10 14:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100125, 134687, 31213, '<td valign="top">A little dark.</td>', 'A little dark.', '2005-01-10 14:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100126, 133201, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. This is similar to my own shot. Therefore I will score it highly ;)</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Yes. This is similar to my own shot. Therefore I will score it highly ;)', '2005-01-10 14:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100128, 134512, 31213, '<td valign="top">Subject is too dar.  nice color and very nice bokeh.  Maybe a small diffused front light or a flash could have made this better.</td>', 'Subject is too dar.  nice color and very nice bokeh.  Maybe a small diffused front light or a flash could have made this better.', '2005-01-10 14:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100129, 134690, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Lots of bokeh here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Actually the background bokeh is very nice, but the subject could be more attractive!</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Lots of bokeh here. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Actually the background bokeh is very nice, but the subject could be more attractive!', '2005-01-10 14:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100130, 134691, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Hmmm, I''d have to say it is so screamingly bright as to detract from the subject(s). And because we can''t tell what the background is, there is no visible relationshiip between fore and back.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Hmmm, I''d have to say it is so screamingly bright as to detract from the subject(s). And because we can''t tell what the background is, there is no visible relationshiip between fore and back.', '2005-01-10 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100131, 134614, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We see that to a degree, but more this is just a shallow DOF setup. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Somewhat. Creative idea, nicely shot, though the lighting is flat.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." We see that to a degree, but more this is just a shallow DOF setup. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Somewhat. Creative idea, nicely shot, though the lighting is flat.', '2005-01-10 14:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100133, 133775, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? I think this photo would have worked better the other way around, with the human in focus. Should also make use of the full 640 pixels allowed on the long side- it would have helped your score a bit.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." Check. Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? I think this photo would have worked better the other way around, with the human in focus. Should also make use of the full 640 pixels allowed on the long side- it would have helped your score a bit.', '2005-01-10 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100135, 134404, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light."Definitely present.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Certainly. Excellent shot in all regards.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light."Definitely present.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Certainly. Excellent shot in all regards.', '2005-01-10 14:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100137, 134597, 9939, '<td valign="top">The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." None to be seen- this is a shallow DOF shot.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Nope. Also looks really REALLY oversaturated.</td>', 'The short definition of Bokeh from KenRockwell.com, which I am using for voting on this challenge: "Bokeh describes the rendition of out-of-focus points of light." None to be seen- this is a shallow DOF shot.  Is the subject enhanced by the bokeh of the background? Nope. Also looks really REALLY oversaturated.', '2005-01-10 14:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
