(1100173, 134003, 17507, '<td valign="top">Now I have to look up "hekobokeh" to figure out what it means. Nice image, too. Great focus. Looks like the drops are frozen. Has this image been rotate 180 degrees?</td>', 'Now I have to look up "hekobokeh" to figure out what it means. Nice image, too. Great focus. Looks like the drops are frozen. Has this image been rotate 180 degrees?', '2005-01-10 14:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
