(1100185, 134150, 19010, '<td valign="top">ok this was my lowest scoring photo and I feel I owe it to you to at least explain why I feel this. First it looks like a photo of a carpet with a tiger on it. I would Have prefered a less flat image. Brokeh the only subject matter is the background at it being out of focus definately does not enhance the image. I have no clue what or why the red lights are so overpowering. They seem to serve no purpose, and do not flatter or enhance the tiger in the background. I don''t intend to be insulting but if a low score is given I feel I should atleast try to explain my reasoning.</td>', 'ok this was my lowest scoring photo and I feel I owe it to you to at least explain why I feel this. First it looks like a photo of a carpet with a tiger on it. I would Have prefered a less flat image. Brokeh the only subject matter is the background at it being out of focus definately does not enhance the image. I have no clue what or why the red lights are so overpowering. They seem to serve no purpose, and do not flatter or enhance the tiger in the background. I don''t intend to be insulting but if a low score is given I feel I should atleast try to explain my reasoning.', '2005-01-10 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100187, 134632, 17507, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desat. The guy in the red hoodie is apparently left-handed, which makes him look a little weird, because images of people "about to swing" often feature the thing to be swung above the right shoulder. But that may be neither here nor there.</td>', 'Good use of selective desat. The guy in the red hoodie is apparently left-handed, which makes him look a little weird, because images of people "about to swing" often feature the thing to be swung above the right shoulder. But that may be neither here nor there.', '2005-01-10 15:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100192, 133201, 17507, '<td valign="top">The background whites help the composition a lot... in fact, they make it. This image probably better meets the challenge than the other 40 or so I''ve looked at so far.</td>', 'The background whites help the composition a lot... in fact, they make it. This image probably better meets the challenge than the other 40 or so I''ve looked at so far.', '2005-01-10 15:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100194, 134572, 19010, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed you made an ugly rather non attractive dead plant look beautifull. The Brokeh adds alot to the photo and the rich gold to honey tones on the petals?  have a nice contrast against the dark center of the plant. one of my top 3 picks keep up the great work.</td>', 'I''m impressed you made an ugly rather non attractive dead plant look beautifull. The Brokeh adds alot to the photo and the rich gold to honey tones on the petals?  have a nice contrast against the dark center of the plant. one of my top 3 picks keep up the great work.', '2005-01-10 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100195, 134546, 17507, '<td valign="top">I love the soft lighting, and the girl is of course lovely, but I think the background actually distracts from the appeal of the image. Contrast is just too high, especially with regard to the headlights.</td>', 'I love the soft lighting, and the girl is of course lovely, but I think the background actually distracts from the appeal of the image. Contrast is just too high, especially with regard to the headlights.', '2005-01-10 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
