(1100199, 134693, 19010, '<td valign="top">great colors and lighting. Textbook Brokeh from my interpretation of it. The brokeh definately adds to the subject of the photo. Its a nice clean crisp and eye pleasing image. One of my top 3 picks.  keep up the good work.</td>', 'great colors and lighting. Textbook Brokeh from my interpretation of it. The brokeh definately adds to the subject of the photo. Its a nice clean crisp and eye pleasing image. One of my top 3 picks.  keep up the good work.', '2005-01-10 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
