(1100243, 133201, 12362, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, any other challenge I would give it a 8.<br/>But from what I understand, the background is supposed to compliment the foreground, unfortunetely I canot see what the Bokeh background is.....Good shot tho...6</td>', 'Very nice picture, any other challenge I would give it a 8.But from what I understand, the background is supposed to compliment the foreground, unfortunetely I canot see what the Bokeh background is.....Good shot tho...6', '2005-01-10 15:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100244, 134197, 13749, '<td valign="top">great saying, have never heard that before.  not sure i would say the bokeh here really helps - maybe it was intended to, but it just seems like a mesh of colors that detract from the cold steel look of the foreground.  sorry if i missed something here.</td>', 'great saying, have never heard that before.  not sure i would say the bokeh here really helps - maybe it was intended to, but it just seems like a mesh of colors that detract from the cold steel look of the foreground.  sorry if i missed something here.', '2005-01-10 15:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100248, 134459, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and technically its a nice shot.<br/>I like how the ocean is the Bokeh, it really emphasises the relationship between the two.<br/>My only beef would be with the composition, I think it would be better to have the shell a little closer to the beach so you can have more of an impact from the ocean/sea.<br/>Good job.</td>', 'Nice idea and technically its a nice shot.I like how the ocean is the Bokeh, it really emphasises the relationship between the two.My only beef would be with the composition, I think it would be better to have the shell a little closer to the beach so you can have more of an impact from the ocean/sea.Good job.', '2005-01-10 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100249, 134605, 25140, '<td valign="top">The background is more interesting than the foreground, but that''s okay with me.  It''s really a great use of bokeh.  I really like the idea and its execution.</td>', 'The background is more interesting than the foreground, but that''s okay with me.  It''s really a great use of bokeh.  I really like the idea and its execution.', '2005-01-10 15:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
