(1100253, 134365, 25140, '<td valign="top">OOO...I like it.  Very pretty.  You''ve framed this shot nicely, and the background definately makes this shot.</td>', 'OOO...I like it.  Very pretty.  You''ve framed this shot nicely, and the background definately makes this shot.', '2005-01-10 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100254, 134800, 25140, '<td valign="top">An interesting perspective.  I like the tones.  I see you have both the foreground and background blurred, a good choice, it makes the ring stand out.</td>', 'An interesting perspective.  I like the tones.  I see you have both the foreground and background blurred, a good choice, it makes the ring stand out.', '2005-01-10 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100255, 133927, 12362, '<td valign="top">Technically fantastic shot!<br/>Sharpness is fantastic, colors are great, the composition is very good also.<br/>Its missing SOMETHING that keeps me from giving it a 9, i think that the shot is not wide enough, chopping off the birds on the right hand side.....8</td>', 'Technically fantastic shot!Sharpness is fantastic, colors are great, the composition is very good also.Its missing SOMETHING that keeps me from giving it a 9, i think that the shot is not wide enough, chopping off the birds on the right hand side.....8', '2005-01-10 15:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100256, 134518, 25397, '<td valign="top">Awesome dreadlocks, reminds me of Zack de la Rocha from Rage Against The Machine</td>', 'Awesome dreadlocks, reminds me of Zack de la Rocha from Rage Against The Machine', '2005-01-10 15:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100257, 134572, 25140, '<td valign="top">I really like the wide contrast of color.  The blurred background is interesting, maybe too interesting, I''m finding myself looking back and forth between the flower, and the background, rather than at the image as a whole.</td>', 'I really like the wide contrast of color.  The blurred background is interesting, maybe too interesting, I''m finding myself looking back and forth between the flower, and the background, rather than at the image as a whole.', '2005-01-10 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100260, 134734, 25140, '<td valign="top">I love how this image is monochromatic.  You''ve really framed the photo nicely too.  Betty is beautiful (and so is the bokeh).</td>', 'I love how this image is monochromatic.  You''ve really framed the photo nicely too.  Betty is beautiful (and so is the bokeh).', '2005-01-10 15:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100263, 134806, 26756, '<td valign="top">That''s definitely bokeh. Now, is it good or bad?  Good in that it''s actually there and not just shallow dof, and it makes for a very interesting photo.  Bad in  a sense that the bokeh is actually more interesting and eye catching than the subject.  I won''t vote you low however, but do you know what I mean?  It''s not enhancing, but overpowering in a way.  Maybe if the candle came up a bit more with a bit of light on it..maybe  at least a full third of the photo would help to emphasize the subject a bit more, then the bokeh would be more of a compliment.  But at least it''s THERE.</td>', 'That''s definitely bokeh. Now, is it good or bad?  Good in that it''s actually there and not just shallow dof, and it makes for a very interesting photo.  Bad in  a sense that the bokeh is actually more interesting and eye catching than the subject.  I won''t vote you low however, but do you know what I mean?  It''s not enhancing, but overpowering in a way.  Maybe if the candle came up a bit more with a bit of light on it..maybe  at least a full third of the photo would help to emphasize the subject a bit more, then the bokeh would be more of a compliment.  But at least it''s THERE.', '2005-01-10 16:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100275, 134588, 19959, '<td valign="top">:-) I see a colored ribbon in your near future. This is excellent.</td>', ':-) I see a colored ribbon in your near future. This is excellent.', '2005-01-10 16:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100279, 134654, 19959, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. Excellent. I thought to try something similar, but couldn''t get a pleasing result. This is exceptional. Top 3.</td>', 'Love this shot. Excellent. I thought to try something similar, but couldn''t get a pleasing result. This is exceptional. Top 3.', '2005-01-10 16:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
