(1100294, 134472, 12362, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE foreground, very sharp and great colors.<br/>But (to me) it falls short in the Bokeh challenge, the bokeh background does not really compliment the foreground, it is just a color. Maybe a whole field of these flowers in the background would be more effective? I would have given it a 9 with better Bokeh, 7</td>', 'VERY NICE foreground, very sharp and great colors.But (to me) it falls short in the Bokeh challenge, the bokeh background does not really compliment the foreground, it is just a color. Maybe a whole field of these flowers in the background would be more effective? I would have given it a 9 with better Bokeh, 7', '2005-01-10 16:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100296, 133694, 12362, '<td valign="top">Nice job in using Bokeh, it compliments the foreground. The coffee cup looks a bit out of focus. The pole does remind me of Venice, 7</td>', 'Nice job in using Bokeh, it compliments the foreground. The coffee cup looks a bit out of focus. The pole does remind me of Venice, 7', '2005-01-10 16:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
