(1100324, 134757, 10658, '<td valign="top">Seems as if his sweater is more in focus than his face, but other than that I think this is a very good shot.  I like the crop and the expression.  Nice colors in the "bokeh".</td>', 'Seems as if his sweater is more in focus than his face, but other than that I think this is a very good shot.  I like the crop and the expression.  Nice colors in the "bokeh".', '2005-01-10 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
