(1100343, 133040, 10658, '<td valign="top">I wish this shot was a little larger so we could see more detail.  As it is the foreground seems to be somewhat out of focus so the whole photo blends together.  I like the idea behind this though.</td>', 'I wish this shot was a little larger so we could see more detail.  As it is the foreground seems to be somewhat out of focus so the whole photo blends together.  I like the idea behind this though.', '2005-01-10 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
