(1100794, 134704, 17103, '<td valign="top">I have tried so to get a decent picture of these pretty birds -- very difficult due to their black and white feathers.  You pulled it off beautifully, and even got a tiny glint in the eye.  The branch is perfectly lit and in focus, and I like the blurred branches in the background.  Very nice!</td>', 'I have tried so to get a decent picture of these pretty birds -- very difficult due to their black and white feathers.  You pulled it off beautifully, and even got a tiny glint in the eye.  The branch is perfectly lit and in focus, and I like the blurred branches in the background.  Very nice!', '2005-01-10 23:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100795, 134404, 17103, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I''m not sure about the composition, but the subdued lighting is beautiful, and I do think the background enhances the subject.</td>', 'This is very nice.  I''m not sure about the composition, but the subdued lighting is beautiful, and I do think the background enhances the subject.', '2005-01-10 23:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100804, 134796, 16106, '<td valign="top">timely and lovely, rich colors and good lines. I wish the lights were a bit more varied and that we could make out a bit more of what made up the bokeh, but that is nitpicking. 8</td>', 'timely and lovely, rich colors and good lines. I wish the lights were a bit more varied and that we could make out a bit more of what made up the bokeh, but that is nitpicking. 8', '2005-01-10 23:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100809, 133729, 16106, '<td valign="top">quite a beautifull composition, but it looks as if the backround is a sheet of ripple glass rather than honest backround blur. If I am wrong you deserve another point or two above 7. Great color balance.</td>', 'quite a beautifull composition, but it looks as if the backround is a sheet of ripple glass rather than honest backround blur. If I am wrong you deserve another point or two above 7. Great color balance.', '2005-01-10 23:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100814, 134775, 16106, '<td valign="top">nice composition but I wish you clould have gotten the forground to pop a bit more ( perhaps a bit darker would have done it even if it made the bee too dark). evokes a lovely feeling of warmth</td>', 'nice composition but I wish you clould have gotten the forground to pop a bit more ( perhaps a bit darker would have done it even if it made the bee too dark). evokes a lovely feeling of warmth', '2005-01-10 23:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100817, 134546, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  And the girl is awesome too!</td>', 'Beautiful image.  And the girl is awesome too!', '2005-01-10 23:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100827, 133674, 2764, '<td valign="top">Oohh lovely - I wish you had either cropped or straightend the sky</td>', 'Oohh lovely - I wish you had either cropped or straightend the sky', '2005-01-10 23:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100833, 133649, 18194, '<td valign="top">Well it is a neat photo to an extent.  The Bokeh is actually rather dull and it does not seem to go with the image we see in the glass, meaning it does not see right that the gray background when seen through the glass would resolve to that nice clear image.  The background does not seem to fit.  To be honest it looks like a gray card behind the glass.</td>', 'Well it is a neat photo to an extent.  The Bokeh is actually rather dull and it does not seem to go with the image we see in the glass, meaning it does not see right that the gray background when seen through the glass would resolve to that nice clear image.  The background does not seem to fit.  To be honest it looks like a gray card behind the glass.', '2005-01-10 23:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100838, 134056, 18194, '<td valign="top">We I have to say this really come off looking like a model, whether it is or not somehow this photos makes it look that way.  I think it is that the DOF is all off.  From where we are looking we should be at least a few thousand feet away from the part that is in focus, and we have several hundred feet that are in focus and yet the background is way out of focus, this just does not look right.  For the monument to be in focus the camera would be focused at very close to infinity.  All of this adds up to an image that just looks wrong with a glance.</td>', 'We I have to say this really come off looking like a model, whether it is or not somehow this photos makes it look that way.  I think it is that the DOF is all off.  From where we are looking we should be at least a few thousand feet away from the part that is in focus, and we have several hundred feet that are in focus and yet the background is way out of focus, this just does not look right.  For the monument to be in focus the camera would be focused at very close to infinity.  All of this adds up to an image that just looks wrong with a glance.', '2005-01-10 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100848, 134815, 23456, '<td valign="top">The tones work great, the red a nice touch. Well done !</td>', 'The tones work great, the red a nice touch. Well done !', '2005-01-11 00:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100849, 134592, 23456, '<td valign="top">Good Shot</td>', 'Good Shot', '2005-01-11 00:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100850, 134709, 23456, '<td valign="top">great tones and contrast. Well done! The only thing when I look at this is the bokeh should have been just in the background and perfectly clear in the foreground under his neck in particular</td>', 'great tones and contrast. Well done! The only thing when I look at this is the bokeh should have been just in the background and perfectly clear in the foreground under his neck in particular', '2005-01-11 00:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100855, 134794, 23456, '<td valign="top">effective shot no doubt,  but I don''t think the bokeh is strong enough ? I guess we all interpret bokeh differently. Whatever is in the top right corner is distracting, but apart from that,  nice and sharp with good colours !</td>', 'effective shot no doubt,  but I don''t think the bokeh is strong enough ? I guess we all interpret bokeh differently. Whatever is in the top right corner is distracting, but apart from that,  nice and sharp with good colours !', '2005-01-11 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100862, 134734, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think you have a winner here.  My only suggestion would be a slightly tighter crop.  I don''t think it needed so much space above.  Beautiful tones and great capture of doggy expression.</td>', 'I think you have a winner here.  My only suggestion would be a slightly tighter crop.  I don''t think it needed so much space above.  Beautiful tones and great capture of doggy expression.', '2005-01-11 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100865, 134704, 25464, '<td valign="top">I will be very surprised if this isn''t in the top 3.  Excellent detail.</td>', 'I will be very surprised if this isn''t in the top 3.  Excellent detail.', '2005-01-11 00:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100869, 134807, 25464, '<td valign="top">Lovely example of bokeh.  I really like the whispy effect of the pine needles.</td>', 'Lovely example of bokeh.  I really like the whispy effect of the pine needles.', '2005-01-11 00:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100871, 134546, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The background color really enhances her lovely eyes.  The angle is great.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The background color really enhances her lovely eyes.  The angle is great.', '2005-01-11 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100874, 133964, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The background works very nicely.  The down side is that it seems a little oversharpened, and I think the border is a little too much.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The background works very nicely.  The down side is that it seems a little oversharpened, and I think the border is a little too much.', '2005-01-11 00:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100883, 134654, 25232, '<td valign="top">Original Idea.</td>', 'Original Idea.', '2005-01-11 01:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100884, 134758, 25232, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and composition.</td>', 'Nice contrast and composition.', '2005-01-11 01:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100888, 133964, 22046, '<td valign="top">I find this quite beautiful. I love the bright drops ringing the red leaves. The soft background shows bokeh at its best. Excellent image.</td>', 'I find this quite beautiful. I love the bright drops ringing the red leaves. The soft background shows bokeh at its best. Excellent image.', '2005-01-11 01:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100889, 133027, 25232, '<td valign="top">Subject seems undifined or out of focus.</td>', 'Subject seems undifined or out of focus.', '2005-01-11 01:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100891, 134805, 22046, '<td valign="top">Great use of color and design. And, yes, bokeh too.</td>', 'Great use of color and design. And, yes, bokeh too.', '2005-01-11 01:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100893, 134794, 22046, '<td valign="top">Bright and colorful. The busy colorful background works well in this image.</td>', 'Bright and colorful. The busy colorful background works well in this image.', '2005-01-11 01:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100895, 134769, 22046, '<td valign="top">The lights and warm brown give a festive feeling to this image. The only thing that bothers me is the bright white area on the left.</td>', 'The lights and warm brown give a festive feeling to this image. The only thing that bothers me is the bright white area on the left.', '2005-01-11 01:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100897, 134807, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea to place the pine cone in the upper left corner. This allows us to really soak in the soft background. The image has a peaceful and dreamy effect. Perfect use of bokeh.</td>', 'Excellent idea to place the pine cone in the upper left corner. This allows us to really soak in the soft background. The image has a peaceful and dreamy effect. Perfect use of bokeh.', '2005-01-11 01:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100900, 134733, 22046, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Very peaceful image. And the sharp focus on the plant and snow is well set off from the dreamy background.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Very peaceful image. And the sharp focus on the plant and snow is well set off from the dreamy background.', '2005-01-11 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100901, 134811, 22046, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, the angle, and the sharp focus on the cork and front of the cork screw. Good use of bokeh.</td>', 'Like the colors, the angle, and the sharp focus on the cork and front of the cork screw. Good use of bokeh.', '2005-01-11 01:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100902, 134283, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very pretty with excellent use of bokeh.</td>', 'Very pretty with excellent use of bokeh.', '2005-01-11 01:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100903, 134588, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very striking image. Excellent example of using bokeh as a key element in your composition.</td>', 'Very striking image. Excellent example of using bokeh as a key element in your composition.', '2005-01-11 01:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100942, 134005, 10658, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites, can''t see a thing wrong with it.  Brilliant!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites, can''t see a thing wrong with it.  Brilliant!', '2005-01-11 02:08:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1100943, 134803, 10658, '<td valign="top">When the challenge is over this should be a print.  Good bokeh, brilliant shot of the raven!  I *love* the look it''s giving you!</td>', 'When the challenge is over this should be a print.  Good bokeh, brilliant shot of the raven!  I *love* the look it''s giving you!', '2005-01-11 02:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100945, 134146, 10658, '<td valign="top">Great idea, good composition, fantastic bokeh.  The only thing I don''t like is that the focus isn''t sharper on the champagne bottle label.  Not a big deal though because the rest of the shot makes up for it I think.</td>', 'Great idea, good composition, fantastic bokeh.  The only thing I don''t like is that the focus isn''t sharper on the champagne bottle label.  Not a big deal though because the rest of the shot makes up for it I think.', '2005-01-11 02:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100946, 134416, 10658, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  I especially like the angle at which the paprika is peeking into the frame :)</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  I especially like the angle at which the paprika is peeking into the frame :)', '2005-01-11 02:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100947, 134246, 10658, '<td valign="top">That looks wicked!  This kind of photo makes me glad to be part of this site because I get to see things that I might never see otherwise :)</td>', 'That looks wicked!  This kind of photo makes me glad to be part of this site because I get to see things that I might never see otherwise :)', '2005-01-11 02:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100950, 134515, 10658, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better if the crop was a little lower, just above the other poinsettias at the top of the photo maybe.  As it is I find the other colors somewhat distracting, but that might just be me :)  Very nice idea and I like the detail in the foreground.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better if the crop was a little lower, just above the other poinsettias at the top of the photo maybe.  As it is I find the other colors somewhat distracting, but that might just be me :)  Very nice idea and I like the detail in the foreground.', '2005-01-11 02:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100952, 134732, 10658, '<td valign="top">Brilliant focus on that water droplet!</td>', 'Brilliant focus on that water droplet!', '2005-01-11 02:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100955, 134472, 10658, '<td valign="top">That''s incredibly lovely.  Beautiful detail, great bokeh, love the drops of water (dew?), excellent composition, great crop...sorry, I''m gushing, I just really like this.</td>', 'That''s incredibly lovely.  Beautiful detail, great bokeh, love the drops of water (dew?), excellent composition, great crop...sorry, I''m gushing, I just really like this.', '2005-01-11 02:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100956, 133958, 10658, '<td valign="top">This would be a great photo to accompany a recipe for those cookies :)  They look very tasty and this is a great shot for, and beyond, this challenge.  Just goes to show how seemingly everyday things can make a great picture :)</td>', 'This would be a great photo to accompany a recipe for those cookies :)  They look very tasty and this is a great shot for, and beyond, this challenge.  Just goes to show how seemingly everyday things can make a great picture :)', '2005-01-11 02:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100958, 134758, 10658, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  I love how the birds are all in focus against that great background.  It''s a really serene photo that will make a lovely print, if you decide to make it one :)</td>', 'Gorgeous!  I love how the birds are all in focus against that great background.  It''s a really serene photo that will make a lovely print, if you decide to make it one :)', '2005-01-11 02:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100961, 134632, 10658, '<td valign="top">That''s just too cool!</td>', 'That''s just too cool!', '2005-01-11 02:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100966, 134644, 30214, '<td valign="top">Iit''s a very good shot, I think it would''ve been stronger with more blurred background and less tight crop in front of the pawn to emphasize  the perspective</td>', 'Iit''s a very good shot, I think it would''ve been stronger with more blurred background and less tight crop in front of the pawn to emphasize  the perspective', '2005-01-11 03:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100971, 134758, 30214, '<td valign="top">great shot! one problem (which I don''t know how to fix) is that the geese feel a little bit unreal against the  background, as if they were pasted from another photo.</td>', 'great shot! one problem (which I don''t know how to fix) is that the geese feel a little bit unreal against the  background, as if they were pasted from another photo.', '2005-01-11 03:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100972, 134690, 30214, '<td valign="top">it may be "bad bokeh" from the technical point of view, but it sure is a nice photo!</td>', 'it may be "bad bokeh" from the technical point of view, but it sure is a nice photo!', '2005-01-11 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100973, 134808, 30214, '<td valign="top">great "bad bokeh"!</td>', 'great "bad bokeh"!', '2005-01-11 03:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100977, 134146, 30214, '<td valign="top">great idea and execution.</td>', 'great idea and execution.', '2005-01-11 03:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1100978, 134646, 30214, '<td valign="top">great idea. Would be more crisp if all nails were in focus.</td>', 'great idea. Would be more crisp if all nails were in focus.', '2005-01-11 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
