(1101173, 134310, 15497, '<td valign="top">//dev.p0ggel.org/gd/archive/lastpod-1105449101.jpg &lt;- My comment</td>', '//dev.p0ggel.org/gd/archive/lastpod-1105449101.jpg <- My comment', '2005-01-11 08:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101205, 133891, 19010, '<td valign="top">I realy like this shot. I feel that the Brokeh realy enhances the image. I also realy like the framing. You have a wonderfull texture in the wood. You are also able to see the wood grains and shapes well. The picture however is missing a center of intrest whaile a wonderfull shot theres nothing in the window. I feel that this is the onlything wrong with the photo. It lacks somthing to keep interested.  While I don''t think this will ribbon without a center of intrest I imagine it will still do pretty good. It is a good axample of brokeh, and is good in all other aspects.<br/> <br/>Keep up the great work</td>', 'I realy like this shot. I feel that the Brokeh realy enhances the image. I also realy like the framing. You have a wonderfull texture in the wood. You are also able to see the wood grains and shapes well. The picture however is missing a center of intrest whaile a wonderfull shot theres nothing in the window. I feel that this is the onlything wrong with the photo. It lacks somthing to keep interested.  While I don''t think this will ribbon without a center of intrest I imagine it will still do pretty good. It is a good axample of brokeh, and is good in all other aspects. Keep up the great work', '2005-01-11 08:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101211, 134605, 2022, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, black and white works well here (7)</td>', 'Interesting composition, black and white works well here (7)', '2005-01-11 08:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101212, 134709, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great photo, nice colors, the diagonal works well here (9)</td>', 'Great photo, nice colors, the diagonal works well here (9)', '2005-01-11 08:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101215, 134771, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like that it is a unique piece of art in this challenge. The black and white against color manages to raise my score most of the time. I realy like the effect it has. I could not however make this one of my top picks for several reasons. First. the blood looks too fake. The red is definately to powerfull. Second the drop of blood at the bottom of the blade looks slightly out of focus. Last of all I just didn''t find it to be real exciting. It does however have alot of good aspects. The brokeh work is great and ads alot to the photo. the B&amp;W w color works well. The knife blade is very crisp and detailed, and the lighting was great. wonderfull shot and deserves every bit of 7 and strongly asking for an 8 imo.</td>', 'I like that it is a unique piece of art in this challenge. The black and white against color manages to raise my score most of the time. I realy like the effect it has. I could not however make this one of my top picks for several reasons. First. the blood looks too fake. The red is definately to powerfull. Second the drop of blood at the bottom of the blade looks slightly out of focus. Last of all I just didn''t find it to be real exciting. It does however have alot of good aspects. The brokeh work is great and ads alot to the photo. the B&W w color works well. The knife blade is very crisp and detailed, and the lighting was great. wonderfull shot and deserves every bit of 7 and strongly asking for an 8 imo.', '2005-01-11 08:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101216, 134245, 2022, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple composition, pleasing colours. Good job (10)</td>', 'Nice, simple composition, pleasing colours. Good job (10)', '2005-01-11 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101217, 134796, 2022, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-01-11 08:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101218, 133964, 26756, '<td valign="top">Returning to comment... Not only are you one of the few photos with actual bokeh, but it also enhances your subject.  It''s nice to see those red leaves against the darker and lighter shades.  Nice contrast.  The perfectly circular ice / water droplets are unusually shaped, but really add interest and beauty to the photo.  Have some more photos to go through yet but IMO this is sure to ribbon.</td>', 'Returning to comment... Not only are you one of the few photos with actual bokeh, but it also enhances your subject.  It''s nice to see those red leaves against the darker and lighter shades.  Nice contrast.  The perfectly circular ice / water droplets are unusually shaped, but really add interest and beauty to the photo.  Have some more photos to go through yet but IMO this is sure to ribbon.', '2005-01-11 08:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101219, 134732, 26756, '<td valign="top">A beautiful macro, great use of dof, but not bokeh in my opinion.  Just a wide open aperture.  I''m not going to beat you down with a 1 though, don''t worry.  Too much confusion in this challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful macro, great use of dof, but not bokeh in my opinion.  Just a wide open aperture.  I''m not going to beat you down with a 1 though, don''t worry.  Too much confusion in this challenge.', '2005-01-11 08:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101220, 133964, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great composition, nice colors. I hope this picture wins a ribbon (10)</td>', 'Great composition, nice colors. I hope this picture wins a ribbon (10)', '2005-01-11 09:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101224, 134485, 2022, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2005-01-11 09:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101225, 134690, 26756, '<td valign="top">Again, one of the few people to actually meet the challenge so you''ll get a decent score from me, but in my opinion the photo is a bit busy and your subject doesn''t really stand out.  Don''t know if it''s the angle or just the subject itself that leaves me just a bit flat compared to a few other photos.  I do like the backlit leaves and the colors.  Plus there is bokeh so that helps.</td>', 'Again, one of the few people to actually meet the challenge so you''ll get a decent score from me, but in my opinion the photo is a bit busy and your subject doesn''t really stand out.  Don''t know if it''s the angle or just the subject itself that leaves me just a bit flat compared to a few other photos.  I do like the backlit leaves and the colors.  Plus there is bokeh so that helps.', '2005-01-11 09:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101226, 134577, 2022, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2005-01-11 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
