(1101236, 133040, 19978, '<td valign="top">Too many elements of his photo are out of focus and compete for attention. The apparent subject, the foreground symbol (?), is very soft too. It''s difficult to tell what your intentions were with this photo, but IMO, it doesn''t work.</td>', 'Too many elements of his photo are out of focus and compete for attention. The apparent subject, the foreground symbol (?), is very soft too. It''s difficult to tell what your intentions were with this photo, but IMO, it doesn''t work.', '2005-01-11 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1101237, 134690, 19978, '<td valign="top">I like the feel  your "bokehed" background gives to this image, but the subject seems to be too spread out and doesn''t have a clear attention getter. A good effort but needed a stronger subject.</td>', 'I like the feel  your "bokehed" background gives to this image, but the subject seems to be too spread out and doesn''t have a clear attention getter. A good effort but needed a stronger subject.', '2005-01-11 09:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
