(1102204, 134404, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  It is a little dark, but the title explains nicely.  The focus and bokeh are great.  I don''t really like the heavy black border.  I think I would have went with a narrower border in a lighter color since the picture is dark.  I think it would have been a little better with a little more blurred yellow in the right background to even things out a little.  Over all very nice shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like this one.  It is a little dark, but the title explains nicely.  The focus and bokeh are great.  I don''t really like the heavy black border.  I think I would have went with a narrower border in a lighter color since the picture is dark.  I think it would have been a little better with a little more blurred yellow in the right background to even things out a little.  Over all very nice shot.  Good luck.', '2005-01-11 19:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102205, 134588, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am really not sure about the bokeh in this one.  It really is the subject and not the background, and by the definitions that I have been reading, it would be considered bad bokeh.  That said, I really like this shot.  It is very interesting and in excellent focus. 9 from me. (terje?)</td>', 'I am really not sure about the bokeh in this one.  It really is the subject and not the background, and by the definitions that I have been reading, it would be considered bad bokeh.  That said, I really like this shot.  It is very interesting and in excellent focus. 9 from me. (terje?)', '2005-01-11 19:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
