(1102273, 134614, 3306, '<td valign="top">Your shot is somewhat similar to mine. Hope you are doing better than I am!!</td>', 'Your shot is somewhat similar to mine. Hope you are doing better than I am!!', '2005-01-11 21:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102275, 134802, 19978, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m a sucker for good guitar shots, but there''s something about this that doesn''t quite work for me. The pegs and bridge are in focus but the gradient toward defocused fretboard seems distracting and off. I love the soft tones and crop, but somehow having so much of the guitar out of focus seems wrong. Still, a good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m a sucker for good guitar shots, but there''s something about this that doesn''t quite work for me. The pegs and bridge are in focus but the gradient toward defocused fretboard seems distracting and off. I love the soft tones and crop, but somehow having so much of the guitar out of focus seems wrong. Still, a good interpretation of the challenge.', '2005-01-11 21:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102279, 133948, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love the concept but the execution feels wrong. The pawn at right is your foreground subject, but the other pawns seem to be caught between prominence and background, without being clearly one or the other. The idea of the "line of pawns" is a compelling chess image. Very nice idea but I fear it will be caught in the middle of the pack somewhere.</td>', 'I love the concept but the execution feels wrong. The pawn at right is your foreground subject, but the other pawns seem to be caught between prominence and background, without being clearly one or the other. The idea of the "line of pawns" is a compelling chess image. Very nice idea but I fear it will be caught in the middle of the pack somewhere.', '2005-01-11 21:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102281, 134588, 19978, '<td valign="top">Whoa. If anyone ever needs a dictionary illustration of what bokeh is, this would be a good choice. A very compelling image. I''m drawn to it. The absolute black of the background makes me feel as though those light sources are floating in space. I''d love to have seen a setup where you could isolate the bulb without having to have a tabletop visible though. Very sweet entry. Should do well.</td>', 'Whoa. If anyone ever needs a dictionary illustration of what bokeh is, this would be a good choice. A very compelling image. I''m drawn to it. The absolute black of the background makes me feel as though those light sources are floating in space. I''d love to have seen a setup where you could isolate the bulb without having to have a tabletop visible though. Very sweet entry. Should do well.', '2005-01-11 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102283, 134797, 19978, '<td valign="top">Technically and aesthetically excellent. My mind and my "soul" are very pleased with this photo. Should be a high finisher.</td>', 'Technically and aesthetically excellent. My mind and my "soul" are very pleased with this photo. Should be a high finisher.', '2005-01-11 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102284, 134784, 31772, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this qualifies as bokeh... neat picture though...</td>', 'I don''t think this qualifies as bokeh... neat picture though...', '2005-01-11 21:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102285, 134800, 31772, '<td valign="top">Sorry, no bokeh here...  like the picture though</td>', 'Sorry, no bokeh here...  like the picture though', '2005-01-11 21:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102287, 134510, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love the earth tones. The background is perfectly indistinct, but complements and strengthens your subject perfectly. This is what I think of when I visualize "good bokeh." Very well done image. Hope you finish high!</td>', 'Love the earth tones. The background is perfectly indistinct, but complements and strengthens your subject perfectly. This is what I think of when I visualize "good bokeh." Very well done image. Hope you finish high!', '2005-01-11 21:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102290, 134796, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. I could see this on a Christmas card or in an advertisement for wine or whatever. Beautifully composed and executed. A fine example of "good bokeh" IMO.</td>', 'Outstanding. I could see this on a Christmas card or in an advertisement for wine or whatever. Beautifully composed and executed. A fine example of "good bokeh" IMO.', '2005-01-11 21:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102295, 134546, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love this portrait. It looks so natural, like a moment caught in passing, freezing in time a fragment of priceless memory. Your model is beautiful, the tilt feels "right" and the background is fuzzily indistinct and just.... perfect. A winner in my opinion.</td>', 'Love this portrait. It looks so natural, like a moment caught in passing, freezing in time a fragment of priceless memory. Your model is beautiful, the tilt feels "right" and the background is fuzzily indistinct and just.... perfect. A winner in my opinion.', '2005-01-11 21:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102296, 134370, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the bokeh made up of the word "Pepsi" has a very weird look to it and hurts the eyes when looked at.  Kind of a cool effect though.</td>', 'Nice idea but the bokeh made up of the word "Pepsi" has a very weird look to it and hurts the eyes when looked at.  Kind of a cool effect though.', '2005-01-11 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102298, 134588, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very colorful well designed and nicely placed. One of my favorites</td>', 'Very colorful well designed and nicely placed. One of my favorites', '2005-01-11 21:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102301, 134365, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image composition with the fuzzy daisies in the background.  Would have liked to have seen this image a bit brighter.  As it is shown here, the light is quite flat and takes away from the main subject''s impact.</td>', 'Nice image composition with the fuzzy daisies in the background.  Would have liked to have seen this image a bit brighter.  As it is shown here, the light is quite flat and takes away from the main subject''s impact.', '2005-01-11 21:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102304, 134678, 19978, '<td valign="top">Captures the intent of the challenge very well, imo. My quibble is that there seems to be something to the left of the focussed bulb that is partially obscuring the bokehed blob just to the left. That and the partially obscured blob to the right add a distracting element to an otherwise excellent shot. An excellent entry.</td>', 'Captures the intent of the challenge very well, imo. My quibble is that there seems to be something to the left of the focussed bulb that is partially obscuring the bokehed blob just to the left. That and the partially obscured blob to the right add a distracting element to an otherwise excellent shot. An excellent entry.', '2005-01-11 21:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102308, 134145, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love guitar shots and yours is an excellent job. There is much here for the eye to feast on. The multi-colored lights in the background are a treat and the reflection of the lights on the strings/fretboard are a touch of genius. I wish more of the guitar in the foreground were sharply focussed, giving the eye a natural "home base" to return to. Still, the bokeh kicks ass.</td>', 'I love guitar shots and yours is an excellent job. There is much here for the eye to feast on. The multi-colored lights in the background are a treat and the reflection of the lights on the strings/fretboard are a touch of genius. I wish more of the guitar in the foreground were sharply focussed, giving the eye a natural "home base" to return to. Still, the bokeh kicks ass.', '2005-01-11 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102310, 134456, 11738, '<td valign="top">Bokeh on this one has a very blocky or jagged feel to it.  Would have liked to see it smoother: probably a digicam limitation.  Nice water droplets on the flower.  Light a bit flat.  Colour correcion with curves might have helped a bit.</td>', 'Bokeh on this one has a very blocky or jagged feel to it.  Would have liked to see it smoother: probably a digicam limitation.  Nice water droplets on the flower.  Light a bit flat.  Colour correcion with curves might have helped a bit.', '2005-01-11 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102314, 134127, 11738, '<td valign="top">Way cool effect, but you have no discernible element in the foreground highlighted by your funky background.</td>', 'Way cool effect, but you have no discernible element in the foreground highlighted by your funky background.', '2005-01-11 21:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102322, 134704, 4793, '<td valign="top">You captured a beautiful little bird here, I envy you I have such a hard time getting close to birds to get this type of shot. Congratulations you did a very nice job with the background.</td>', 'You captured a beautiful little bird here, I envy you I have such a hard time getting close to birds to get this type of shot. Congratulations you did a very nice job with the background.', '2005-01-11 21:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
