(1102465, 133812, 30861, '<td valign="top">Dark areas of subject getting lost. I wish the ice were sharper, or the water if that''s what it is. Bokeh present but not especially effective to composition, more of a backdrop than an active element. I am scoring higher the ones where bokeh and subject are in an active dialogue with each other.</td>', 'Dark areas of subject getting lost. I wish the ice were sharper, or the water if that''s what it is. Bokeh present but not especially effective to composition, more of a backdrop than an active element. I am scoring higher the ones where bokeh and subject are in an active dialogue with each other.', '2005-01-11 22:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
