(1102541, 134409, 28141, '<td valign="top">The baby is almost too out of focus for my taste.  I like the concept and I though I was really going to like the image after seeing the thumbnail, but in full size and detail the baby is a little too amorphous.</td>', 'The baby is almost too out of focus for my taste.  I like the concept and I though I was really going to like the image after seeing the thumbnail, but in full size and detail the baby is a little too amorphous.', '2005-01-11 23:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102544, 134056, 28141, '<td valign="top">The bokeh doesn''t really enhance the image here, rather it gives it an unsettling feeling.  I really like the in focus part, but the bokeh part is making me a little sea sick.</td>', 'The bokeh doesn''t really enhance the image here, rather it gives it an unsettling feeling.  I really like the in focus part, but the bokeh part is making me a little sea sick.', '2005-01-11 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1102546, 134183, 28141, '<td valign="top">Since the bokeh shell (an urchin?) is so much bigger than the in focus one, it''s rather distracting and doesn''t seem to enhance the subject.</td>', 'Since the bokeh shell (an urchin?) is so much bigger than the in focus one, it''s rather distracting and doesn''t seem to enhance the subject.', '2005-01-11 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
