(1102556, 133972, 28141, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the big candle seems a little out of focus too (i''m assuming that''s meant to be the in focus part).  It also would be much more interesting if it weren''t centered.</td>', 'Good idea, but the big candle seems a little out of focus too (i''m assuming that''s meant to be the in focus part).  It also would be much more interesting if it weren''t centered.', '2005-01-11 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
