(1103700, 134794, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. The background compliments the subject nicely, and the subject is nice and crisp. However, in my opinion, it''s not a perfect example of using bokeh to enhance an image. I tend to think of bokeh as ''out-of-focus specular highlights.'' To me, this is more an example of shallow depth of field. But, it''s such a great photo that I can''t see myself giving it less than a 10. Congratulations on a wonderful photo!<br/></td>', 'This is a beautiful image. The background compliments the subject nicely, and the subject is nice and crisp. However, in my opinion, it''s not a perfect example of using bokeh to enhance an image. I tend to think of bokeh as ''out-of-focus specular highlights.'' To me, this is more an example of shallow depth of field. But, it''s such a great photo that I can''t see myself giving it less than a 10. Congratulations on a wonderful photo!', '2005-01-12 10:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
