(1104085, 134451, 16636, '<td valign="top">beautifully done,,reall appealing shape to this image, shame about the spiders web (I presume)  on the bottom two stems</td>', 'beautifully done,,reall appealing shape to this image, shame about the spiders web (I presume)  on the bottom two stems', '2005-01-12 13:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104088, 134508, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is cheating. Using glass is strictly prohibited because it produces instant bokeh. Note some of the blobs and they tell you how many blades the shutter has.<br/>Very nice image with great romatic colors and the bokeh does not take first billing. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is cheating. Using glass is strictly prohibited because it produces instant bokeh. Note some of the blobs and they tell you how many blades the shutter has.Very nice image with great romatic colors and the bokeh does not take first billing. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104091, 134588, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is very nice but you realize that this is bokeh overkill. Not to worry because you have manged to turn it into an abstract work of art. Lucky you. lol Bumping up.</td>', 'This is very nice but you realize that this is bokeh overkill. Not to worry because you have manged to turn it into an abstract work of art. Lucky you. lol Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104097, 134145, 22734, '<td valign="top">Another bokeh overkill, but not to worry. You have created a unique image whuth that abstract look and all is forgiven. Bumping up.</td>', 'Another bokeh overkill, but not to worry. You have created a unique image whuth that abstract look and all is forgiven. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104105, 134808, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good visual.</td>', 'A very good visual.', '2005-01-12 13:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104106, 134802, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very interesting effect. It is like the road to... Bumping up.</td>', 'A very interesting effect. It is like the road to... Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104109, 134757, 22734, '<td valign="top">A good example wherin the bokeh complements the image without distracting or taking first billing. Bumping up.</td>', 'A good example wherin the bokeh complements the image without distracting or taking first billing. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104120, 134769, 22734, '<td valign="top">A pleasant layout with great crystal. The yellow-amber spirits add to the merry go round of colors at the base of the vesel. Just a little more distance would have mellowed the bokeh on the left. However, I am splitting hairs, you have accomplished the mission and the composition is great. Bumping up.</td>', 'A pleasant layout with great crystal. The yellow-amber spirits add to the merry go round of colors at the base of the vesel. Just a little more distance would have mellowed the bokeh on the left. However, I am splitting hairs, you have accomplished the mission and the composition is great. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104125, 134654, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good effort which approaches the line into abstact art. The colors are just great since they represent dusk. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very good effort which approaches the line into abstact art. The colors are just great since they represent dusk. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104130, 134695, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good specimen that utilizes bokeh without hitting in the face with rings, blobs and eye floaters. This is a subject (the thorns) that is allowe to sing while the background supports like all good backgrounds, in an unobtrusive manner. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very good specimen that utilizes bokeh without hitting in the face with rings, blobs and eye floaters. This is a subject (the thorns) that is allowe to sing while the background supports like all good backgrounds, in an unobtrusive manner. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104145, 134734, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good image with the spherical version of bokeh done without the background overcoming the the subject. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very good image with the spherical version of bokeh done without the background overcoming the the subject. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104283, 134704, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice bokeh, the off-center subject is a plus for this shot</td>', 'very nice bokeh, the off-center subject is a plus for this shot', '2005-01-12 15:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104303, 134510, 23913, '<td valign="top">very nice shot lov this one the color could be warmer and still have that bleak affect but you shot it so who am i to say-10</td>', 'very nice shot lov this one the color could be warmer and still have that bleak affect but you shot it so who am i to say-10', '2005-01-12 15:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104328, 134783, 3102, '<td valign="top">Clever title!</td>', 'Clever title!', '2005-01-12 15:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104367, 134083, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely magical! The lighting on the central bud is just beautiful and defines the edges to just the right extent. The background is what lifts the shot to another plane though - the depth of the blue, the vivid green of the foliage below and the blurred stems and flowers of the rest of the plant all combine in just the right abstract shapes with just the right textures to ilicit a WOW! One of my favourite entries!</td>', 'Absolutely magical! The lighting on the central bud is just beautiful and defines the edges to just the right extent. The background is what lifts the shot to another plane though - the depth of the blue, the vivid green of the foliage below and the blurred stems and flowers of the rest of the plant all combine in just the right abstract shapes with just the right textures to ilicit a WOW! One of my favourite entries!', '2005-01-12 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104371, 134604, 3087, '<td valign="top">I adore this image - it''s beautiful and that diamond shaped pattern in the background creates a strangely enclosed feel even though we''re looking at an open area of flowers. It''s beautiful and one of my very favourite entries in this challenge! Thank you!</td>', 'I adore this image - it''s beautiful and that diamond shaped pattern in the background creates a strangely enclosed feel even though we''re looking at an open area of flowers. It''s beautiful and one of my very favourite entries in this challenge! Thank you!', '2005-01-12 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104374, 133891, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful framing! The texture and shapes are beautiful and the shallow depth of field reduces the background to an almost abstract series of vertical shapes. Certainly in my top 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful framing! The texture and shapes are beautiful and the shallow depth of field reduces the background to an almost abstract series of vertical shapes. Certainly in my top 10 in this challenge.', '2005-01-12 15:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104380, 134802, 3087, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love how the stillness of the guitar body is offset by the motion of the strings! The pattern you have captured from that motion is incredible!  Viewpoint is excellent and makes a very strong composition. Black background is just right and echoes the dark shadows within the lower half of the frame. One of my top 3 entries in this challenge.</td>', 'I absolutely love how the stillness of the guitar body is offset by the motion of the strings! The pattern you have captured from that motion is incredible!  Viewpoint is excellent and makes a very strong composition. Black background is just right and echoes the dark shadows within the lower half of the frame. One of my top 3 entries in this challenge.', '2005-01-12 15:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104393, 134577, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love creative and quirky use of colour and this is certainly that. I love how the blurred background patterns of the other items in the set are repeated in the foreground cup but are clear and solid there. The frozen motion of the tea is an excellent addition and lit superbly well and provides that elusive extra element that makes the image click for me. One of my top 10 in this challenge.</td>', 'I love creative and quirky use of colour and this is certainly that. I love how the blurred background patterns of the other items in the set are repeated in the foreground cup but are clear and solid there. The frozen motion of the tea is an excellent addition and lit superbly well and provides that elusive extra element that makes the image click for me. One of my top 10 in this challenge.', '2005-01-12 15:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104402, 134514, 3087, '<td valign="top">On of my top 11 (yes 11) in this challenge. This captures wonderfully the interplay between moving water and light. I also really like the shapes in an abstract sense - I think the composition is very strong on that level. The lack of colour allows me to really concentrate on the light and forms here. Wonderful!</td>', 'On of my top 11 (yes 11) in this challenge. This captures wonderfully the interplay between moving water and light. I also really like the shapes in an abstract sense - I think the composition is very strong on that level. The lack of colour allows me to really concentrate on the light and forms here. Wonderful!', '2005-01-12 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104409, 134732, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some might dismiss this as merely shallow DOF and not bokeh but since I''m using the broader definition of bokeh as the aesthetic contributions to overall image of the blurred areas of an image this works for me! And it''s one of my top 5 favourite entries in the challenge. I just love the way the blurred branch curving away into the corner creates a sense of compositional balance and depth to the image. It''s just gorgeous!</td>', 'Some might dismiss this as merely shallow DOF and not bokeh but since I''m using the broader definition of bokeh as the aesthetic contributions to overall image of the blurred areas of an image this works for me! And it''s one of my top 5 favourite entries in the challenge. I just love the way the blurred branch curving away into the corner creates a sense of compositional balance and depth to the image. It''s just gorgeous!', '2005-01-12 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104416, 134451, 3087, '<td valign="top">This would be an interesting image without shallow depth of field simply because of the wonderful composition created by the strong points of focus and curving lines. But the way that shallow depth of field has transformed much of the image into this incredible soft yet textured blur just takes it to another level. The lines aren''t just blurred, they seem to blend across each other in a most pleasing way. One of my top 11 in this challenge.</td>', 'This would be an interesting image without shallow depth of field simply because of the wonderful composition created by the strong points of focus and curving lines. But the way that shallow depth of field has transformed much of the image into this incredible soft yet textured blur just takes it to another level. The lines aren''t just blurred, they seem to blend across each other in a most pleasing way. One of my top 11 in this challenge.', '2005-01-12 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104421, 133201, 3087, '<td valign="top">At first I looked at this and thought, "oh yeah, so they got a leaf and were able to get some diffused light spot in the background". But as I looked at it more it grew on me to a surprising extent. The lighting on the leaf is beautiful and that golden, sunlit colour just makes me feel warm and happy. But it''s only with the addition of the pale, colour-coloured light spots that the composition suddenly achieves something more than just a leaf with some negative space included in the frame. It really works for me. One of my top 11 in this challenge.</td>', 'At first I looked at this and thought, "oh yeah, so they got a leaf and were able to get some diffused light spot in the background". But as I looked at it more it grew on me to a surprising extent. The lighting on the leaf is beautiful and that golden, sunlit colour just makes me feel warm and happy. But it''s only with the addition of the pale, colour-coloured light spots that the composition suddenly achieves something more than just a leaf with some negative space included in the frame. It really works for me. One of my top 11 in this challenge.', '2005-01-12 15:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104429, 134133, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really love this as an abstract. The strong light and shadow, especially with the focal point on the water droplet, the strong diagonal lines and the randomly positioned light circles create a composition that seems to resonate far more strongly with me than I entirely understand. One of my top 11 in the challenge.</td>', 'I really love this as an abstract. The strong light and shadow, especially with the focal point on the water droplet, the strong diagonal lines and the randomly positioned light circles create a composition that seems to resonate far more strongly with me than I entirely understand. One of my top 11 in the challenge.', '2005-01-12 16:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104574, 134352, 24065, '<td valign="top">So THAT''s what one looks like!  Great!  :)</td>', 'So THAT''s what one looks like!  Great!  :)', '2005-01-12 16:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104582, 133964, 18715, '<td valign="top">I llike the water pearls. thanks for the shot!</td>', 'I llike the water pearls. thanks for the shot!', '2005-01-12 17:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104616, 134771, 8139, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Nice bokeh too. Imaginative selective desaturation. 10</td>', 'Gorgeous. Nice bokeh too. Imaginative selective desaturation. 10', '2005-01-12 17:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104658, 134687, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, brilliant use of bokeh! 10</td>', 'Very nicely done, brilliant use of bokeh! 10', '2005-01-12 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104684, 134565, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like the photo. However your strogest bokeh is from the foreground, and the challenge was to use the background bokeh to enhance the photo. A change in positions would do the trick. In other words, focus on the duck in the foreground and blur the one in the background.</td>', 'I like the photo. However your strogest bokeh is from the foreground, and the challenge was to use the background bokeh to enhance the photo. A change in positions would do the trick. In other words, focus on the duck in the foreground and blur the one in the background.', '2005-01-12 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104689, 134675, 4267, '<td valign="top">totally uber. This is only the 2nd photo I have seen for this challenge, but my guess is that it won;t get much better. I am betting you get a ribbon. Nice job. How many shots did it take to get it right?</td>', 'totally uber. This is only the 2nd photo I have seen for this challenge, but my guess is that it won;t get much better. I am betting you get a ribbon. Nice job. How many shots did it take to get it right?', '2005-01-12 17:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104691, 134815, 25388, '<td valign="top">great capture; sharpness and focus is right on;expression is delightful and your capture of bokeh is exactly how I interpret bokeh. Bump to 9<br/></td>', 'great capture; sharpness and focus is right on;expression is delightful and your capture of bokeh is exactly how I interpret bokeh. Bump to 9', '2005-01-12 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104694, 134585, 4267, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and color. The candle in the foreground could use a bit more focus.</td>', 'beautiful composition and color. The candle in the foreground could use a bit more focus.', '2005-01-12 17:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104698, 134691, 4267, '<td valign="top">nice work with the bokeh. but not super interesting as a subject.</td>', 'nice work with the bokeh. but not super interesting as a subject.', '2005-01-12 17:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104701, 134183, 4267, '<td valign="top">bokeh is there, but the shot is kinda boring</td>', 'bokeh is there, but the shot is kinda boring', '2005-01-12 17:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104708, 134803, 4267, '<td valign="top">your background is really more of a negative space rather than a bokeh. for me this does not meet the challenge.</td>', 'your background is really more of a negative space rather than a bokeh. for me this does not meet the challenge.', '2005-01-12 17:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104713, 134127, 4267, '<td valign="top">while you have a blurred background, you don;t really have an in focus subject for the background to highlight. for me this shot does not meet the challenge</td>', 'while you have a blurred background, you don;t really have an in focus subject for the background to highlight. for me this shot does not meet the challenge', '2005-01-12 17:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104743, 134810, 26653, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  The bg is perfect, and I like the pod drooping down under the weight of the snow.  nice muted color too.</td>', 'Beautifully done!  The bg is perfect, and I like the pod drooping down under the weight of the snow.  nice muted color too.', '2005-01-12 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104751, 134771, 24079, '<td valign="top">I really llike this one, it''s kind of frightening but what''s wrong with that?</td>', 'I really llike this one, it''s kind of frightening but what''s wrong with that?', '2005-01-12 18:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104755, 134734, 26653, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful!!  Love the colors, the bg is perfect. <br/>My only suggestion would be to fill more of the frame with Betty''s head.  It looks a little cut off from the rest of her body - like she couldn''t quite reach far enough into the frame.  I think I would experiment with some cropping and the frame it.<br/>Great lighting and detail on this too.</td>', 'Really beautiful!!  Love the colors, the bg is perfect. My only suggestion would be to fill more of the frame with Betty''s head.  It looks a little cut off from the rest of her body - like she couldn''t quite reach far enough into the frame.  I think I would experiment with some cropping and the frame it.Great lighting and detail on this too.', '2005-01-12 18:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104797, 134572, 19978, '<td valign="top">There is something very nice about this image that I just can''t put my finger on. It''s a wonderfully nontraditional flower (or whatever), so it''s unusual and captures my attention. It''s off-centered, cropped composition is very nice and works well IMO. The de-focused background compliments perfectly, and I believe adds significantly to the impact of the picture. Overall, I''d say it''s one of the more technically perfect images in this challenge, and should do well. Very nice.</td>', 'There is something very nice about this image that I just can''t put my finger on. It''s a wonderfully nontraditional flower (or whatever), so it''s unusual and captures my attention. It''s off-centered, cropped composition is very nice and works well IMO. The de-focused background compliments perfectly, and I believe adds significantly to the impact of the picture. Overall, I''d say it''s one of the more technically perfect images in this challenge, and should do well. Very nice.', '2005-01-12 18:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104800, 134197, 19978, '<td valign="top">I like this. It has a very unbalanced feel to it (color on the right, BW on the left) and very much an "edgy" photo (no pun intended). The bokeh is sooooo smooth and the lighting perfect. A magical photo. Bumping up.</td>', 'I like this. It has a very unbalanced feel to it (color on the right, BW on the left) and very much an "edgy" photo (no pun intended). The bokeh is sooooo smooth and the lighting perfect. A magical photo. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 18:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104834, 134679, 11793, '<td valign="top">i don''t like the border.<br/>photo is good.</td>', 'i don''t like the border.photo is good.', '2005-01-12 18:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104851, 134690, 4338, '<td valign="top">excelent Bokeh</td>', 'excelent Bokeh', '2005-01-12 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104906, 133109, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great composition - very well ballanced with obvious bokeh.</td>', 'Great composition - very well ballanced with obvious bokeh.', '2005-01-12 19:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104907, 134518, 11793, '<td valign="top">i think i know who took this.  though i''ll refrain form posting until after.<br/>good luck</td>', 'i think i know who took this.  though i''ll refrain form posting until after.good luck', '2005-01-12 19:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104913, 134619, 4285, '<td valign="top">I see an image with no obvious bokeh.  In fact, it is practically in focus in all of the frame. Sorry if you misunderstood the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'I see an image with no obvious bokeh.  In fact, it is practically in focus in all of the frame. Sorry if you misunderstood the theme of the challenge.', '2005-01-12 19:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104914, 134705, 11793, '<td valign="top">focus too soft overall.<br/></td>', 'focus too soft overall.', '2005-01-12 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104917, 134704, 4285, '<td valign="top">Even without the signature circle of confusion artifacts, I would still consider this bokeh. I think your composition is classic rule of thirds. Good job.</td>', 'Even without the signature circle of confusion artifacts, I would still consider this bokeh. I think your composition is classic rule of thirds. Good job.', '2005-01-12 19:43:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1104918, 134416, 11793, '<td valign="top">slightly crooked BG.<br/></td>', 'slightly crooked BG.', '2005-01-12 19:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104919, 134546, 11793, '<td valign="top">well done portrait.  good luck<br/>seems a tad soft on the eyes.</td>', 'well done portrait.  good luckseems a tad soft on the eyes.', '2005-01-12 19:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104920, 133846, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nailed the focus on your subject, and allowed the background to blend into a dreamy, almost painted feel. A perfect exampled of the bokeh enhancing the overall image. Beautiful.</td>', 'Nailed the focus on your subject, and allowed the background to blend into a dreamy, almost painted feel. A perfect exampled of the bokeh enhancing the overall image. Beautiful.', '2005-01-12 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104921, 133731, 4285, '<td valign="top">Very nice bokeh and goode placement of subject, although I think it needed to be turned towards the camera more, so that it becomes more obvious what it actually is. I think that would make it more interesting. Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice bokeh and goode placement of subject, although I think it needed to be turned towards the camera more, so that it becomes more obvious what it actually is. I think that would make it more interesting. Bumping up.', '2005-01-12 19:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104923, 134416, 19978, '<td valign="top">A very well done shot, maybe technically perfect, but it seems to be lacking the punch or the pop that makes a good image great.</td>', 'A very well done shot, maybe technically perfect, but it seems to be lacking the punch or the pop that makes a good image great.', '2005-01-12 19:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104924, 134713, 4285, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don''t see bokeh in this image.</td>', 'Sorry but I don''t see bokeh in this image.', '2005-01-12 19:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104931, 133793, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is my third time returning to your shot trying to decide what I want to say. While I love the colorful burst it contains, the colors seem to be a bit overdone. I like the bokeh, but think maybe the lower left flower makes for too many elements - not giving the eye a clear focus point, or place to rest. I REALLY want to like this shot more, but keep feeling conflicted. A tad too busy? A single flower with your wonderfully soft background might have been a winner.</td>', 'This is my third time returning to your shot trying to decide what I want to say. While I love the colorful burst it contains, the colors seem to be a bit overdone. I like the bokeh, but think maybe the lower left flower makes for too many elements - not giving the eye a clear focus point, or place to rest. I REALLY want to like this shot more, but keep feeling conflicted. A tad too busy? A single flower with your wonderfully soft background might have been a winner.', '2005-01-12 19:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104932, 134546, 28568, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, fantastic colours.</td>', 'Excellent shot, fantastic colours.', '2005-01-12 19:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104937, 134693, 19978, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful shot of a flower, but I don''t really think the softly blurring background is bokeh. My understanding of bokeh may be as fuzzy as the effect itself though. I like the picture and think it''s well done. Not sure why it was challenged though. The composition might have been better off center.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful shot of a flower, but I don''t really think the softly blurring background is bokeh. My understanding of bokeh may be as fuzzy as the effect itself though. I like the picture and think it''s well done. Not sure why it was challenged though. The composition might have been better off center.', '2005-01-12 19:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104938, 134723, 28568, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the sharpness is amazing!</td>', 'Great shot, the sharpness is amazing!', '2005-01-12 19:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1104944, 133649, 28568, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot, well thought.</td>', 'Wow! Great shot, well thought.', '2005-01-12 20:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105031, 134718, 31036, '<td valign="top">nice composition and idea, but it would be nice if one of the flames were in focus.</td>', 'nice composition and idea, but it would be nice if one of the flames were in focus.', '2005-01-12 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105033, 134159, 31036, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, beautiful subject.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, beautiful subject.', '2005-01-12 21:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105036, 134310, 31036, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot w/ great colors</td>', 'Interesting shot w/ great colors', '2005-01-12 21:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105038, 134413, 31036, '<td valign="top">Incredible</td>', 'Incredible', '2005-01-12 21:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105042, 134632, 31036, '<td valign="top">One of the best I''ve come across so far</td>', 'One of the best I''ve come across so far', '2005-01-12 21:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105067, 134211, 23471, '<td valign="top">very nice foreground/background bokeh element</td>', 'very nice foreground/background bokeh element', '2005-01-12 21:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105078, 133629, 25787, '<td valign="top">Bokeh??  But I really like the portrait.</td>', 'Bokeh??  But I really like the portrait.', '2005-01-12 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105082, 134146, 25787, '<td valign="top">My favorite Champaigne!</td>', 'My favorite Champaigne!', '2005-01-12 22:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105162, 134172, 24239, '<td valign="top">great colors and abstract quality</td>', 'great colors and abstract quality', '2005-01-12 23:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105168, 134723, 31399, '<td valign="top">call me nuts cause i HATE SNAKES!!!!!!!!  but...I found it very interesting that I felt it interesting one has to FIND the direction the snake is heading in the phote as one does in real life...where''s the tail...true so true..I like the phote :-)<br/></td>', 'call me nuts cause i HATE SNAKES!!!!!!!!  but...I found it very interesting that I felt it interesting one has to FIND the direction the snake is heading in the phote as one does in real life...where''s the tail...true so true..I like the phote :-)', '2005-01-13 00:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105170, 134334, 31399, '<td valign="top">Nice title</td>', 'Nice title', '2005-01-13 00:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105174, 133219, 31399, '<td valign="top">can i have the puppy?</td>', 'can i have the puppy?', '2005-01-13 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105177, 134757, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait with nice bokeh.  I think improvement could be made in the focus (seems to be on the color/chin/mouth rather than the eyes/nose/mouth.  Additionally, the bokeh should (to achieve a wow factor) enhance the subject.  The background here is fine, but could have been improved if it had picked up some of the color of the sweater.  The shadow of the nose is a little distracting as well.  All of that said, I still like it very much. 7.</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait with nice bokeh.  I think improvement could be made in the focus (seems to be on the color/chin/mouth rather than the eyes/nose/mouth.  Additionally, the bokeh should (to achieve a wow factor) enhance the subject.  The background here is fine, but could have been improved if it had picked up some of the color of the sweater.  The shadow of the nose is a little distracting as well.  All of that said, I still like it very much. 7.', '2005-01-13 00:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105181, 133891, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot. The focus is great and the background compliments the subject nicely.  I could see this shot being used in print.  Can''t find a thing wrong with it.  Bumping up to 10.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot. The focus is great and the background compliments the subject nicely.  I could see this shot being used in print.  Can''t find a thing wrong with it.  Bumping up to 10.', '2005-01-13 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105184, 134301, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think the DOF is a bit too shallow.  I would have liked it better if more of the pine cone were in good focus.  The colors and composition are nice.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think the DOF is a bit too shallow.  I would have liked it better if more of the pine cone were in good focus.  The colors and composition are nice.', '2005-01-13 00:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105185, 134796, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice holiday shot.  Demonstrates the challenge well. Background is also connected to the subject for extra umph.  I would have tied a ribbon to the ornament.  You would have given my holiday shot a run for the money.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice holiday shot.  Demonstrates the challenge well. Background is also connected to the subject for extra umph.  I would have tied a ribbon to the ornament.  You would have given my holiday shot a run for the money.  Good luck.', '2005-01-13 00:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105187, 134815, 25464, '<td valign="top">This shows nice bokeh that is related to the subject.  Cute kid, nice smile, and nice colors.  My only complaint is the crop.  This would have been much better with both hands showing on the shovel rather than one arm cropped out.  Still very nice.</td>', 'This shows nice bokeh that is related to the subject.  Cute kid, nice smile, and nice colors.  My only complaint is the crop.  This would have been much better with both hands showing on the shovel rather than one arm cropped out.  Still very nice.', '2005-01-13 00:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105189, 134352, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Nice bokeh.  Great composition except for the bit of missing tail feather.  A little dark, but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Great shot.  Nice bokeh.  Great composition except for the bit of missing tail feather.  A little dark, but otherwise very nice.', '2005-01-13 00:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105190, 134648, 31399, '<td valign="top">I''ma country gurl and i LOVE this PHOTE...made me smile</td>', 'I''ma country gurl and i LOVE this PHOTE...made me smile', '2005-01-13 00:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105192, 134295, 25464, '<td valign="top">The light in this shot is amazing.  The out of focus foreground branch is a bit distracting, but that is my only complaint.  Otherwise lovely.</td>', 'The light in this shot is amazing.  The out of focus foreground branch is a bit distracting, but that is my only complaint.  Otherwise lovely.', '2005-01-13 00:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105194, 133674, 25464, '<td valign="top">What a pretty cow.  The composition has potential.  I think it could have been improved if you had squatted down a bit, for a more direct angle on the cow and the inclusion of a bit of level skyline.  The seemingly off level landscape, showing a smidge of sky on only one side, is distracting.  The background cows are great.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-20 01:14:37.</i></td>', 'What a pretty cow.  The composition has potential.  I think it could have been improved if you had squatted down a bit, for a more direct angle on the cow and the inclusion of a bit of level skyline.  The seemingly off level landscape, showing a smidge of sky on only one side, is distracting.  The background cows are great.', '2005-01-13 00:23:47.000000', '2005-01-20 01:14:37.000000', 1),
(1105196, 134409, 25464, '<td valign="top">Different.  Nice focus on the subject. Good bokeh background connected to the subject.  Good composition.  Something about this doesn''t work for me, but it is not technical.  I think it is the fact that the background is a baby with no face.  I don''t really know how else to explain.  Good effort, and I could see this being in demand as a stockphoto to be used in parenting magaziines.  Just not something I would hang on my wall. 8.</td>', 'Different.  Nice focus on the subject. Good bokeh background connected to the subject.  Good composition.  Something about this doesn''t work for me, but it is not technical.  I think it is the fact that the background is a baby with no face.  I don''t really know how else to explain.  Good effort, and I could see this being in demand as a stockphoto to be used in parenting magaziines.  Just not something I would hang on my wall. 8.', '2005-01-13 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105197, 134408, 25464, '<td valign="top">Cutie.  My personal preference would be to see this as a closer face shot removing the swing; however, it is nice this way as well.  Good bokeh.</td>', 'Cutie.  My personal preference would be to see this as a closer face shot removing the swing; however, it is nice this way as well.  Good bokeh.', '2005-01-13 00:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
