(1105628, 133731, 4041, '<td valign="top">i like how the lights accentuate the curves</td>', 'i like how the lights accentuate the curves', '2005-01-13 09:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105653, 134618, 4285, '<td valign="top">What I see is a photo with shallow DOF without taking full advantage of the bokeh effect. You may have been better off showing how your big glass could be used to produce the bokeh effect, rather than showing your big glass.</td>', 'What I see is a photo with shallow DOF without taking full advantage of the bokeh effect. You may have been better off showing how your big glass could be used to produce the bokeh effect, rather than showing your big glass.', '2005-01-13 09:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105656, 133966, 4285, '<td valign="top">You have produced bokeh in this photograph that certainly isolates the subject from the BG. That being said, your focus is a little soft on the face and hand of the statue, where the eyes tend to be drawn.</td>', 'You have produced bokeh in this photograph that certainly isolates the subject from the BG. That being said, your focus is a little soft on the face and hand of the statue, where the eyes tend to be drawn.', '2005-01-13 10:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105659, 134803, 4285, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Edgar Allan Poe. Black subjects are very hard to capture well - there is a fine line between getting enough contrast in the image without blowing out any highlights. I think you have done this efectively, although I find your focus a touch soft.  The bokeh you have produced is sufficient to isolate the subject from the BG, even though there are no tell-tale artifacts to suggest that this bokeh isn''t just a solid BG, slightly OOF. Still I really like it and is one of my top picks.</td>', 'Reminds me of Edgar Allan Poe. Black subjects are very hard to capture well - there is a fine line between getting enough contrast in the image without blowing out any highlights. I think you have done this efectively, although I find your focus a touch soft.  The bokeh you have produced is sufficient to isolate the subject from the BG, even though there are no tell-tale artifacts to suggest that this bokeh isn''t just a solid BG, slightly OOF. Still I really like it and is one of my top picks.', '2005-01-13 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105665, 134783, 4285, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the soft circle of light effect. Looks like a touch over sharpened by looking at the area under the chin of the chess piece and at the lower right. Cropping the base of the piece would have been nicer in my opinion, because my eye seems to be drawn to the red in the lower right corner. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Love the colours and the soft circle of light effect. Looks like a touch over sharpened by looking at the area under the chin of the chess piece and at the lower right. Cropping the base of the piece would have been nicer in my opinion, because my eye seems to be drawn to the red in the lower right corner. Hope this is helpful.', '2005-01-13 10:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105672, 134816, 4285, '<td valign="top">The colour combinations are nice but I find there is nothing in the image that suggests bokeh. In fact I don''t find anything to be in particularly good focus, let alone a subject with an OOF BG. Maybe if you set it up so that the tiny glass guitar was your subject set against (not on top of - at some distance) a back drop of your full size guitar which could be completely OOF, it could work better</td>', 'The colour combinations are nice but I find there is nothing in the image that suggests bokeh. In fact I don''t find anything to be in particularly good focus, let alone a subject with an OOF BG. Maybe if you set it up so that the tiny glass guitar was your subject set against (not on top of - at some distance) a back drop of your full size guitar which could be completely OOF, it could work better', '2005-01-13 10:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105674, 134546, 32016, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph of a beautiful girl, nice job!</td>', 'This is a great photograph of a beautiful girl, nice job!', '2005-01-13 10:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105678, 134614, 32016, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  I can''t imagine how long it took to get this shot.  The white balance looks off though; it looks a bit red. Maybe you intended that.  Anyway, cool shot.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  I can''t imagine how long it took to get this shot.  The white balance looks off though; it looks a bit red. Maybe you intended that.  Anyway, cool shot.', '2005-01-13 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105696, 134459, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s not a bad shot, good composition but I think this would look much better about 1 stop less exposed.  However, it´s IMO not on topic for this challenge since there is no Bokeh.</td>', 'It´s not a bad shot, good composition but I think this would look much better about 1 stop less exposed.  However, it´s IMO not on topic for this challenge since there is no Bokeh.', '2005-01-13 10:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
