(1105713, 133649, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a good Idea with good bokeh but a little tight for my opinion, the glass ever so barelyl fits in the frame.  Good shot anyways, good luck in this challenge.</td>', 'It´s a good Idea with good bokeh but a little tight for my opinion, the glass ever so barelyl fits in the frame.  Good shot anyways, good luck in this challenge.', '2005-01-13 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105717, 134083, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a good shot, good exposure and colours but what drag it down IMO is the busy backround.  Just the straws at the bottom would have been enough for my taste.  Anyway, like the shot.</td>', 'It´s a good shot, good exposure and colours but what drag it down IMO is the busy backround.  Just the straws at the bottom would have been enough for my taste.  Anyway, like the shot.', '2005-01-13 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105722, 134811, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good shot, great colours and great DOF but I don´t find the subject particularly interesting, after looking at this image for 1 second I have seen everything I need to see.  To be clear though I like this image, I bet it would look good in a catalouge for wine.</td>', 'Good shot, great colours and great DOF but I don´t find the subject particularly interesting, after looking at this image for 1 second I have seen everything I need to see.  To be clear though I like this image, I bet it would look good in a catalouge for wine.', '2005-01-13 11:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105725, 134240, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea but not executed.  To me at least it looks like nothing is in focus in this shot and that is its biggest weaknes IMO.  I like that it´s BW though and the tones in it and the centered framing works well here.  Just get it in focus next time and you will have a great shot.</td>', 'Good idea but not executed.  To me at least it looks like nothing is in focus in this shot and that is its biggest weaknes IMO.  I like that it´s BW though and the tones in it and the centered framing works well here.  Just get it in focus next time and you will have a great shot.', '2005-01-13 11:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105727, 134758, 9504, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That is gorgeous!! 10</td>', 'Wow.  That is gorgeous!! 10', '2005-01-13 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105732, 134815, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cropped a bit too tightly for my personal taste but this is a good shot, good colours, good bokeh and good sharpness.</td>', 'Cropped a bit too tightly for my personal taste but this is a good shot, good colours, good bokeh and good sharpness.', '2005-01-13 11:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105737, 134338, 9504, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful creature.</td>', 'What a beautiful creature.', '2005-01-13 11:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105887, 133040, 26679, '<td valign="top">the backgraound for me is too obvious, and thefore misses the bokeh feel.<br/> <br/>I like the general balance of the composition, but wonder whetherthe lamp on the right creates too much glare behind the drummer.</td>', 'the backgraound for me is too obvious, and thefore misses the bokeh feel. I like the general balance of the composition, but wonder whetherthe lamp on the right creates too much glare behind the drummer.', '2005-01-13 13:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1105956, 134734, 24860, '<td valign="top">The picture looks great bu I the background may be a little over-blurred. It''s hard to tell what it is exactly.</td>', 'The picture looks great bu I the background may be a little over-blurred. It''s hard to tell what it is exactly.', '2005-01-13 14:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106007, 134559, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent macro. Nice of your model to sit so still for you. :)</td>', 'This is an excellent macro. Nice of your model to sit so still for you. :)', '2005-01-13 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106074, 134475, 30364, '<td valign="top">Mundane subject made spectacular by the bokeh effect.  What makes it so striking for me is that the in-focus elements are not confined to the nominative subject ... the strong diagonal slashes of the leaves almost appear to be slipping in an out of sharp focus, creating the illusion of movement, as well as an abstract feel.  If I imagine it with ONLY the seed head in focus, it would not have the impact you have achieved.  And of course, if it were ALL in focus, it would be nothing at all.  So I think that is what''s meant by bokeh.  Also like the absence of any competing colours.  Very, very good.  I learned a lot from this photo.  Thanks!  10.</td>', 'Mundane subject made spectacular by the bokeh effect.  What makes it so striking for me is that the in-focus elements are not confined to the nominative subject ... the strong diagonal slashes of the leaves almost appear to be slipping in an out of sharp focus, creating the illusion of movement, as well as an abstract feel.  If I imagine it with ONLY the seed head in focus, it would not have the impact you have achieved.  And of course, if it were ALL in focus, it would be nothing at all.  So I think that is what''s meant by bokeh.  Also like the absence of any competing colours.  Very, very good.  I learned a lot from this photo.  Thanks!  10.', '2005-01-13 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106091, 134802, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this done before, from both the bridge and the nut, but this one is very nice.  7.</td>', 'I''ve seen this done before, from both the bridge and the nut, but this one is very nice.  7.', '2005-01-13 15:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
