(1106299, 133839, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is quite on challenge; I know the books are not in sharp focus, but I don''t think that makes it bokeh.  Nice candid looking shot though.  5.</td>', 'I don''t think this is quite on challenge; I know the books are not in sharp focus, but I don''t think that makes it bokeh.  Nice candid looking shot though.  5.', '2005-01-13 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106313, 134146, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well that''s pretty clever, and I think it''s what bokeh is really about (it''s got to be a critical creative element of the overall impact, not just some out-of-focus crap).  I''d like it even more if the bottle label had a tiny bit more of a "glow" somehow, to more closely match the "bubbles".  But it''s still damn good.  8.</td>', 'Well that''s pretty clever, and I think it''s what bokeh is really about (it''s got to be a critical creative element of the overall impact, not just some out-of-focus crap).  I''d like it even more if the bottle label had a tiny bit more of a "glow" somehow, to more closely match the "bubbles".  But it''s still damn good.  8.', '2005-01-13 17:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106320, 134172, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yep, that works for me.  The out-of-focus elements contribute to the impact of the foreground subject.  7.</td>', 'Yep, that works for me.  The out-of-focus elements contribute to the impact of the foreground subject.  7.', '2005-01-13 17:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106330, 134675, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clever.  The block pattern in the background does seem appropriate and adds to the Scrabble theme.  Shot through a glass surface?  7.</td>', 'Clever.  The block pattern in the background does seem appropriate and adds to the Scrabble theme.  Shot through a glass surface?  7.', '2005-01-13 17:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106332, 134204, 23312, '<td valign="top">I see the humor with the ball positioning, and maybe you were adding some anonymity as well - but in this case I think it detracts.  I mean, I love this shot - it''s very well done, except the ball placement is too artificial and for me it wrecks the illusion.</td>', 'I see the humor with the ball positioning, and maybe you were adding some anonymity as well - but in this case I think it detracts.  I mean, I love this shot - it''s very well done, except the ball placement is too artificial and for me it wrecks the illusion.', '2005-01-13 17:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
