(1106338, 134546, 23312, '<td valign="top">Very pretty eyes, good bokeh if I even know what that is, I like the angle, colors, and lighting - but I think the girl is a bit too centered.  I''d be tempeted to crop of some of the right side where the background is dark.</td>', 'Very pretty eyes, good bokeh if I even know what that is, I like the angle, colors, and lighting - but I think the girl is a bit too centered.  I''d be tempeted to crop of some of the right side where the background is dark.', '2005-01-13 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106344, 134204, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see BOTH foreground &amp; background elements out of focus.  But I''m not convinced that makes it bokeh.  And I''m afraid I don''t believe the ball at all.  5.</td>', 'Interesting to see BOTH foreground & background elements out of focus.  But I''m not convinced that makes it bokeh.  And I''m afraid I don''t believe the ball at all.  5.', '2005-01-13 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
