(1106346, 134679, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love it how the strong, warm yellow/orange saturated flower pops out of the soft cool background.<br/>The spot on the vase that shines pretty bright is distracting, it might tell something about bokeh, but it breaks the soft eveness of the background. 10 anyway. :)</td>', 'I love it how the strong, warm yellow/orange saturated flower pops out of the soft cool background.The spot on the vase that shines pretty bright is distracting, it might tell something about bokeh, but it breaks the soft eveness of the background. 10 anyway. :)', '2005-01-13 17:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
