(1106680, 134789, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The background compliments the subject perfectly in tone and feel. Too bad you couldn''t pull out a bit more detail in the black feathers of the head. Nice job overall.</td>', 'Very nice. The background compliments the subject perfectly in tone and feel. Too bad you couldn''t pull out a bit more detail in the black feathers of the head. Nice job overall.', '2005-01-13 21:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
