(1106788, 133219, 23680, '<td valign="top">Could that be the cutest face :)  Nice concept and composition.</td>', 'Could that be the cutest face :)  Nice concept and composition.', '2005-01-13 23:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106802, 134732, 25553, '<td valign="top">good clarity on the subject, simple and elegant. nice and sharp, great color difference between foreground and background.</td>', 'good clarity on the subject, simple and elegant. nice and sharp, great color difference between foreground and background.', '2005-01-13 23:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106807, 134372, 25553, '<td valign="top">wouldve liked more dramatic lighting on the master  and more variety in the sharpness of the background.. gaussian blur?</td>', 'wouldve liked more dramatic lighting on the master  and more variety in the sharpness of the background.. gaussian blur?', '2005-01-13 23:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106808, 134246, 25553, '<td valign="top">nice contrast.</td>', 'nice contrast.', '2005-01-13 23:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106810, 134366, 25553, '<td valign="top">everything seems equally soft.  and the background doest involve me.</td>', 'everything seems equally soft.  and the background doest involve me.', '2005-01-13 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106816, 134650, 25553, '<td valign="top">a tighter crop with only her mouth and hand wouldve really said "whipped cream taste test". it would take some focus off of the out of focus part.</td>', 'a tighter crop with only her mouth and hand wouldve really said "whipped cream taste test". it would take some focus off of the out of focus part.', '2005-01-13 23:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106873, 134736, 25232, '<td valign="top">A bit much of a green cast. I know this is what you were aiming at but it seems a tad strong. Just going trough and looking again, I like the composition and the subject. The background bokeh looks good. I''ll bump you up a bit.</td>', 'A bit much of a green cast. I know this is what you were aiming at but it seems a tad strong. Just going trough and looking again, I like the composition and the subject. The background bokeh looks good. I''ll bump you up a bit.', '2005-01-14 00:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106874, 134803, 25232, '<td valign="top">The bokeh is obscure at best. Too bland. Bird looks cool.</td>', 'The bokeh is obscure at best. Too bland. Bird looks cool.', '2005-01-14 00:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106876, 133040, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that depth of field limitations = bokeh.  Sorry. 4.</td>', 'I don''t feel that depth of field limitations = bokeh.  Sorry. 4.', '2005-01-14 01:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106877, 133414, 25232, '<td valign="top">Bokeh is a bit too well defined. Should be a little smoother, but you got the general idea.</td>', 'Bokeh is a bit too well defined. Should be a little smoother, but you got the general idea.', '2005-01-14 01:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106878, 134461, 25232, '<td valign="top">Subject should be in better focus. Would have scored better had it been.</td>', 'Subject should be in better focus. Would have scored better had it been.', '2005-01-14 01:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106879, 134505, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh, bull!  (Just kidding).</td>', 'Oh, bull!  (Just kidding).', '2005-01-14 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106882, 133629, 30364, '<td valign="top">This challenge started January 3rd ..,. It''ll be a bloody long wait!</td>', 'This challenge started January 3rd ..,. It''ll be a bloody long wait!', '2005-01-14 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106884, 133388, 25232, '<td valign="top">The composition is week. Perhaps you could have angled the shot or done a verticle. Bokeh looks a bit hard. Doesn''t add a lot to the subject. Flower itself looks sharp.</td>', 'The composition is week. Perhaps you could have angled the shot or done a verticle. Bokeh looks a bit hard. Doesn''t add a lot to the subject. Flower itself looks sharp.', '2005-01-14 01:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106887, 133443, 25232, '<td valign="top">You need to focus better on your subject, and the big gray foreground detracts.<br/>Bokeh on the rear flowers looks good. If you could have done the whole background like that you would have scored much better.</td>', 'You need to focus better on your subject, and the big gray foreground detracts.Bokeh on the rear flowers looks good. If you could have done the whole background like that you would have scored much better.', '2005-01-14 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106891, 134451, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well that''s visually spectacular &amp; pretty good for the challenge subject.  There''s some sort of spiderweb or thread near the bottom; -1 = 7</td>', 'Well that''s visually spectacular & pretty good for the challenge subject.  There''s some sort of spiderweb or thread near the bottom; -1 = 7', '2005-01-14 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106892, 134512, 25232, '<td valign="top">Composition seems weak. Maybe not. Nice bokeh and color. Great contrast.<br/> <br/>Try experimenting with the composition. Something about it make me feel uneasy.<br/>Looking at this again, I''ll give you a bump up.</td>', 'Composition seems weak. Maybe not. Nice bokeh and color. Great contrast. Try experimenting with the composition. Something about it make me feel uneasy.Looking at this again, I''ll give you a bump up.', '2005-01-14 01:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106904, 134589, 30364, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty stock brokeh shot to me.  5.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty stock brokeh shot to me.  5.', '2005-01-14 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106905, 134370, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hope this doesn''t sound absurd, but I like the composition.  Having said that, it''s a clever entry. 7.</td>', 'Hope this doesn''t sound absurd, but I like the composition.  Having said that, it''s a clever entry. 7.', '2005-01-14 01:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106908, 134485, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo.  Visually arresting &amp; technically very impressive.  9.</td>', 'Terrific photo.  Visually arresting & technically very impressive.  9.', '2005-01-14 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106911, 134491, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well I''m not absolutely confident with the subject of this challenge, but I''m pretty sure this effort is exactly right; an out-of-focus background without which the actual subject would be diminished.  So, the colours, the pattern and the emotional "feel" of the bokeh contribute much this image.  Like good theatrical lighting (i.e. on stage in a theatre), this bokeh gives presence and mood to the performer.  9.</td>', 'Well I''m not absolutely confident with the subject of this challenge, but I''m pretty sure this effort is exactly right; an out-of-focus background without which the actual subject would be diminished.  So, the colours, the pattern and the emotional "feel" of the bokeh contribute much this image.  Like good theatrical lighting (i.e. on stage in a theatre), this bokeh gives presence and mood to the performer.  9.', '2005-01-14 01:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106912, 133964, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty good; wiithout the bokeh effect, the beautifully-fringed leaves would not have this impact.  For example, if you''d shot against a perfectly plain dark "studio"-type background you''d still get the contrast against the moisture droplets, but you wouldn''t get the striking natural feel you have achieved.   9.</td>', 'That''s pretty good; wiithout the bokeh effect, the beautifully-fringed leaves would not have this impact.  For example, if you''d shot against a perfectly plain dark "studio"-type background you''d still get the contrast against the moisture droplets, but you wouldn''t get the striking natural feel you have achieved.   9.', '2005-01-14 01:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106915, 134807, 30364, '<td valign="top">Back for a second look to bump up from 6 to 7.  The whispy pine needles make a clever visual  and focus bridge between the subject pine cone and the presumably snowy background scene.  That''s a nice touch.  So 7.  No ... it''s even better than that; 8.</td>', 'Back for a second look to bump up from 6 to 7.  The whispy pine needles make a clever visual  and focus bridge between the subject pine cone and the presumably snowy background scene.  That''s a nice touch.  So 7.  No ... it''s even better than that; 8.', '2005-01-14 01:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106922, 134803, 255, '<td valign="top">quite dark, but still discernible background.  sets the dark mood associated with poe nicely.  great composition as well.</td>', 'quite dark, but still discernible background.  sets the dark mood associated with poe nicely.  great composition as well.', '2005-01-14 01:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1106930, 134642, 31505, '<td valign="top">sorry i cant vote for this pic.  i would have givin it a ten.</td>', 'sorry i cant vote for this pic.  i would have givin it a ten.', '2005-01-14 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1107015, 134803, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this meets the challenge.  3.  <br/>Back for second thoughts; maybe it does?  The background''s apparently not in focus, but does it add anyting at all to the image (anything that a blank sheet of blackish paper wouldn''t have?). <br/>Hell, who knows?  Better make it a 5.</td>', 'I don''t think this meets the challenge.  3.  Back for second thoughts; maybe it does?  The background''s apparently not in focus, but does it add anyting at all to the image (anything that a blank sheet of blackish paper wouldn''t have?). Hell, who knows?  Better make it a 5.', '2005-01-14 03:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1107017, 134822, 30364, '<td valign="top">They are out of focus, but that''s not enough, is it?  I think it''s supposed to be a bit more subtle than that.  4.<br/> <br/>Well maybe subtle''s not the word.  Creative?</td>', 'They are out of focus, but that''s not enough, is it?  I think it''s supposed to be a bit more subtle than that.  4. Well maybe subtle''s not the word.  Creative?', '2005-01-14 03:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1107031, 134573, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, but I don''t think that "mostly blurry" is the point of this challenge.  Have a look at the entry called "the seed".  Cheers.  5.<br/> <br/>P.S.  I mean the all-green one, featuring a seed head &amp; diagonal blades of grass (there''s another one called "Seed".  Cheers!</td>', 'Yes it is, but I don''t think that "mostly blurry" is the point of this challenge.  Have a look at the entry called "the seed".  Cheers.  5. P.S.  I mean the all-green one, featuring a seed head & diagonal blades of grass (there''s another one called "Seed".  Cheers!', '2005-01-14 03:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1107041, 134240, 30364, '<td valign="top">Could this have also worked the other way round (foreground out of focus)?  As it is, I''d rate it higher if the star thing itself appeared imore sharply in focus.  It''s a good idea, though.  6.</td>', 'Could this have also worked the other way round (foreground out of focus)?  As it is, I''d rate it higher if the star thing itself appeared imore sharply in focus.  It''s a good idea, though.  6.', '2005-01-14 03:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1107052, 134546, 30364, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a strikingly pretty girl, but is the blurry background really bokeh, or is it just blurry?  6.<br/>Oh, maybe it is after all; 7.</td>', 'Great shot of a strikingly pretty girl, but is the blurry background really bokeh, or is it just blurry?  6.Oh, maybe it is after all; 7.', '2005-01-14 03:59:50.000000', NULL, 1);
