(1107433, 134693, 15832, '<td valign="top">There is alot of very nice photos in this challenge but i think this one is gonna get a ribbon! Well done. The nicest i´ve seen so far 10</td>', 'There is alot of very nice photos in this challenge but i think this one is gonna get a ribbon! Well done. The nicest i´ve seen so far 10', '2005-01-14 11:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
