(1107660, 134675, 29799, '<td valign="top">I''m not yet a member, so I dont get to vote, but I think this photo is fantastic! I love the use of the scrabble board as a backdrip, and the "floating" letters are great. The title caps it off! Well done!<br/> <br/>Jen</td>', 'I''m not yet a member, so I dont get to vote, but I think this photo is fantastic! I love the use of the scrabble board as a backdrip, and the "floating" letters are great. The title caps it off! Well done! Jen', '2005-01-14 14:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1107763, 134343, 31036, '<td valign="top">Would''ve liked to see better focus on the shot. Nicely composed, though.</td>', 'Would''ve liked to see better focus on the shot. Nicely composed, though.', '2005-01-14 15:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
