(1107774, 134796, 25742, '<td valign="top">Strong image. Nice FG, exactly the right DOF and nice bokeh. Good. Few minor nags: border cuts through light-blob at Top L and just R of top middle. Slightly different crop would fix that. Also  my eye seems to be drawn towards the small point of light between the leaves in lower L.<br/>Overall: Very good. /8</td>', 'Strong image. Nice FG, exactly the right DOF and nice bokeh. Good. Few minor nags: border cuts through light-blob at Top L and just R of top middle. Slightly different crop would fix that. Also  my eye seems to be drawn towards the small point of light between the leaves in lower L.Overall: Very good. /8', '2005-01-14 15:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
