(1107986, 134575, 31408, '<td valign="top">Color scheme is a little bland.  The shot could be well served with a solid color table cloth - maybe a deep red or semi-bright ivory.</td>', 'Color scheme is a little bland.  The shot could be well served with a solid color table cloth - maybe a deep red or semi-bright ivory.', '2005-01-14 18:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108016, 134817, 31742, '<td valign="top">very cool picture<br/></td>', 'very cool picture', '2005-01-14 18:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108021, 133649, 31742, '<td valign="top">beatuiful peice of art!!!</td>', 'beatuiful peice of art!!!', '2005-01-14 18:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108150, 134736, 23394, '<td valign="top">love the treatment on this; excellent choice of colors.  the razor sharp focus is really brought out by the background, which here enhances without distracting.  you might have burned in the brighter part of the background up near the top, but it''s not bad as is.  great expression.  this also would look good with more negative space up in the top left.</td>', 'love the treatment on this; excellent choice of colors.  the razor sharp focus is really brought out by the background, which here enhances without distracting.  you might have burned in the brighter part of the background up near the top, but it''s not bad as is.  great expression.  this also would look good with more negative space up in the top left.', '2005-01-14 19:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108153, 134806, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image.  reminds me of a 60''s poster/album cover.  excellent focus.  this image almost looks like an animated crowd watching the flame perform.  interesting choice of colors for the final presentation.  as far as bokeh goes, you have to answer for yourself as to whether or not you intended the hard edged circles.  nice work.  good luck.</td>', 'this is an interesting image.  reminds me of a 60''s poster/album cover.  excellent focus.  this image almost looks like an animated crowd watching the flame perform.  interesting choice of colors for the final presentation.  as far as bokeh goes, you have to answer for yourself as to whether or not you intended the hard edged circles.  nice work.  good luck.', '2005-01-14 20:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108160, 134525, 19408, '<td valign="top">that''s beautiful background boke. i wonder what lens you used. the subject is less interesting though. 8.</td>', 'that''s beautiful background boke. i wonder what lens you used. the subject is less interesting though. 8.', '2005-01-14 20:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108169, 133388, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image, but the lighting is a bit harsh.  as a result, your bokeh is a bit more of a distraction than an enhancement.  one way to adjust this is to add an overlay layer, select a large brush, set to opacity 30, then set your foreground color to black.  then just lightly paint in the brighter areas.  the composition is nice, and the colors are rich--it''s just the background that needs work, imho.  good luck.</td>', 'this is an interesting image, but the lighting is a bit harsh.  as a result, your bokeh is a bit more of a distraction than an enhancement.  one way to adjust this is to add an overlay layer, select a large brush, set to opacity 30, then set your foreground color to black.  then just lightly paint in the brighter areas.  the composition is nice, and the colors are rich--it''s just the background that needs work, imho.  good luck.', '2005-01-14 20:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108173, 134298, 23394, '<td valign="top">this might not work for some voters, but i like it.  you have met the challenge without over-doing it.  good luck.</td>', 'this might not work for some voters, but i like it.  you have met the challenge without over-doing it.  good luck.', '2005-01-14 20:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108176, 133414, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea and a fun composition.  it meets the challenge for me without over-doing it.  however, the image itself seems a bit flat.  maybe with a bit more contrast and a bit brighter, but as is, it''s just not popping.  good luck!</td>', 'this is a great idea and a fun composition.  it meets the challenge for me without over-doing it.  however, the image itself seems a bit flat.  maybe with a bit more contrast and a bit brighter, but as is, it''s just not popping.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108183, 134807, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like the idea behind the composition, but am not bowled over by the execution.  while i like the general organization of the image, i don''t like how the pine needles are melting into the background.  the bokeh is fine, but i think your image would have been stronger if there was a bit more focus on the needles.</td>', 'i like the idea behind the composition, but am not bowled over by the execution.  while i like the general organization of the image, i don''t like how the pine needles are melting into the background.  the bokeh is fine, but i think your image would have been stronger if there was a bit more focus on the needles.', '2005-01-14 20:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108186, 134458, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is cute, and it the bw is fine.  you have achieved a bokeh effect, for sure.  the question is, what is the background doing for the image?  is it distracting my attention from the subject, or is it enhancing my view of the subject?  unfortunately, with the heavy dark negative space in the bottom right, the lights are competing, and, in my view, not really enhancing the image.</td>', 'this is cute, and it the bw is fine.  you have achieved a bokeh effect, for sure.  the question is, what is the background doing for the image?  is it distracting my attention from the subject, or is it enhancing my view of the subject?  unfortunately, with the heavy dark negative space in the bottom right, the lights are competing, and, in my view, not really enhancing the image.', '2005-01-14 20:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108197, 134608, 23394, '<td valign="top">your lighting here, if you haven''t been told already, is a bit too strong.  it''s always easier to recover from underexposure than overexposure, but there are some tricks that you can use under advanced editing to correct this...<br/> <br/>the image is cute and works well with the background.  as a rule, though, centered focus doesn''t make for the most interesting images because that tends to put the subject in your face without inviting your eyes to wander around.  good luck!</td>', 'your lighting here, if you haven''t been told already, is a bit too strong.  it''s always easier to recover from underexposure than overexposure, but there are some tricks that you can use under advanced editing to correct this... the image is cute and works well with the background.  as a rule, though, centered focus doesn''t make for the most interesting images because that tends to put the subject in your face without inviting your eyes to wander around.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108201, 134781, 23394, '<td valign="top">you have done a great job here in terms of composition and meeting the challenge.  your bokeh not only enhances the image, but is interesting and diverse.  kudos to that.  my problem is that your focus on your subject is a bit on the soft side.  that is one thing that really takes away from an otherwise excellent entry.</td>', 'you have done a great job here in terms of composition and meeting the challenge.  your bokeh not only enhances the image, but is interesting and diverse.  kudos to that.  my problem is that your focus on your subject is a bit on the soft side.  that is one thing that really takes away from an otherwise excellent entry.', '2005-01-14 20:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108205, 133272, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you have acheived technical bokeh, but, unfortunately, you have not put it to good use...  here, the background is more of the subject than the leaf, and that''s too bad.  this is one image where you really could have taken advantage of advanced editing rules.  if you had boosted the saturization on the leaf itself and cropped off the right 2/3s of the image, you would have had something to capture attention and entertain the eyes...as is, my eyes wander, searching for a subject.  good luck!</td>', 'yes, you have acheived technical bokeh, but, unfortunately, you have not put it to good use...  here, the background is more of the subject than the leaf, and that''s too bad.  this is one image where you really could have taken advantage of advanced editing rules.  if you had boosted the saturization on the leaf itself and cropped off the right 2/3s of the image, you would have had something to capture attention and entertain the eyes...as is, my eyes wander, searching for a subject.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108207, 134546, 23394, '<td valign="top">very dynamic angle.  love the way her eyes line up with the headlights.  good work!  also love the colors.</td>', 'very dynamic angle.  love the way her eyes line up with the headlights.  good work!  also love the colors.', '2005-01-14 20:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108209, 134146, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you have achieved techical bokeh, but, to me, it is providing more of a distracting background than an enhancing one.  maybe with a little more light on the bottle, and if the glass had been placed so that it isn''t swallowed by the background, it would have worked.  as is, it''s a bit too busy.  good luck!</td>', 'yes, you have achieved techical bokeh, but, to me, it is providing more of a distracting background than an enhancing one.  maybe with a little more light on the bottle, and if the glass had been placed so that it isn''t swallowed by the background, it would have worked.  as is, it''s a bit too busy.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108210, 134145, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow!  those colors just POP!  this looks like somebody went to a lot of effort to make this image happen.  good luck!</td>', 'wow!  those colors just POP!  this looks like somebody went to a lot of effort to make this image happen.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108212, 134413, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent image with great bokeh.  you probably could have saturated the leaf just a tad more to offer a bit more contrast, but all the same, this rocks!  excellent work, hope to see you on the front page!</td>', 'this is an excellent image with great bokeh.  you probably could have saturated the leaf just a tad more to offer a bit more contrast, but all the same, this rocks!  excellent work, hope to see you on the front page!', '2005-01-14 20:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108213, 134796, 23394, '<td valign="top">good work here.  too bad the focus is so soft on the subject...just kidding!!!  your background spots of light are a bit strong, but within reason.  good overall choice of colors.  good luck!</td>', 'good work here.  too bad the focus is so soft on the subject...just kidding!!!  your background spots of light are a bit strong, but within reason.  good overall choice of colors.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108216, 134678, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a nice, simple, clean image.  i like the colors and the general composition.  i usually don''t care about borders one way or another, except when they are overdone (and i think this is a bit overdone).  good luck!</td>', 'this is a nice, simple, clean image.  i like the colors and the general composition.  i usually don''t care about borders one way or another, except when they are overdone (and i think this is a bit overdone).  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108217, 134783, 23394, '<td valign="top">very interesting composition, if a bit on the dark side.  you have a nice bokeh that enhances the overall image.  good luck!</td>', 'very interesting composition, if a bit on the dark side.  you have a nice bokeh that enhances the overall image.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108220, 134472, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image with a good bokeh--not too much, not too little.  the problem with the image is the general composition of your subject.  by centering it the way you have, you have created a horizon that is splitting the image in the middle, leaving your bokeh at the top and the under-exposed bottom of the flower below.  it''s a shame, because the water drops and textures in the lighter areas have a lot of promise.  good luck!</td>', 'nice image with a good bokeh--not too much, not too little.  the problem with the image is the general composition of your subject.  by centering it the way you have, you have created a horizon that is splitting the image in the middle, leaving your bokeh at the top and the under-exposed bottom of the flower below.  it''s a shame, because the water drops and textures in the lighter areas have a lot of promise.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 20:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108251, 134592, 23394, '<td valign="top">most excellent bokeh!  cannot say the same about the time of day you chose to shoot, though--you have lost too many details in a statuette that looks like it has a story to tell.  and that''s a shame, because this is a great example of using the background to make the subject pop.  good luck!</td>', 'most excellent bokeh!  cannot say the same about the time of day you chose to shoot, though--you have lost too many details in a statuette that looks like it has a story to tell.  and that''s a shame, because this is a great example of using the background to make the subject pop.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 21:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108261, 134133, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting composition.  i like the subdued bokeh (as opposed to some of the seriously-in-your-face bokeh).  however, the reed with the droplet is too soft and blown out, which really undermine the image.  if that reed could have stood out without the blowouts, the image would have had a much stronger impact.  good luck!</td>', 'interesting composition.  i like the subdued bokeh (as opposed to some of the seriously-in-your-face bokeh).  however, the reed with the droplet is too soft and blown out, which really undermine the image.  if that reed could have stood out without the blowouts, the image would have had a much stronger impact.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 21:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108270, 134819, 23394, '<td valign="top">you have achieved bokeh, of sorts, but it isn''t really enhancing your image.  here, it has an artificial quality that is more of a distraction than anything else.  overall, i find the composition is very busy, almost like you were trying to get as much into the image as possible.</td>', 'you have achieved bokeh, of sorts, but it isn''t really enhancing your image.  here, it has an artificial quality that is more of a distraction than anything else.  overall, i find the composition is very busy, almost like you were trying to get as much into the image as possible.', '2005-01-14 21:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108273, 133964, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image with good bokeh.  i wonder if you could have shot it on a slightly different angle that would have allowed you to keep the whole subject in sharp focus.  well, i won''t quibble about that.  the colors are outstanding and you definitely hit the challenge.  hope to see you on the home page!</td>', 'this is an interesting image with good bokeh.  i wonder if you could have shot it on a slightly different angle that would have allowed you to keep the whole subject in sharp focus.  well, i won''t quibble about that.  the colors are outstanding and you definitely hit the challenge.  hope to see you on the home page!', '2005-01-14 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108275, 134404, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is almost perfect.  a little on the dark side, but i''m not going to complain.  great work.  hope to see you on the front page!</td>', 'this is almost perfect.  a little on the dark side, but i''m not going to complain.  great work.  hope to see you on the front page!', '2005-01-14 21:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108280, 134758, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, and overall, a stunning capture.  the background, though, is a bit too in focus.  this is a place where you really could have taken advantage of the advanced editing rules: by selecting for the background and creating a layer from that, you could have applied a gaussian blur that would have easily put this on the front page!  you still might consider doing that; it would make one killer print!  good luck!</td>', 'beautiful image, and overall, a stunning capture.  the background, though, is a bit too in focus.  this is a place where you really could have taken advantage of the advanced editing rules: by selecting for the background and creating a layer from that, you could have applied a gaussian blur that would have easily put this on the front page!  you still might consider doing that; it would make one killer print!  good luck!', '2005-01-14 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108282, 134451, 23394, '<td valign="top">i keep coming back to this image over and over, and i still don''t know what to make of it.  i like it.  it has some very interesting qualities.  the composition and focus are incredible.  there is nothing i can add here except to say, "good luck!"</td>', 'i keep coming back to this image over and over, and i still don''t know what to make of it.  i like it.  it has some very interesting qualities.  the composition and focus are incredible.  there is nothing i can add here except to say, "good luck!"', '2005-01-14 21:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108285, 134704, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent capture, excellent exposure.  very good work.  will be very surprised if this doesn''t show up on the front page when this is over.  good luck!</td>', 'excellent capture, excellent exposure.  very good work.  will be very surprised if this doesn''t show up on the front page when this is over.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 21:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108288, 133109, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful.  excellent composition and choice of colors.  you have definitely nailed the challenge here.  good luck!</td>', 'this is beautiful.  excellent composition and choice of colors.  you have definitely nailed the challenge here.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 21:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108290, 134775, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, how i like this.  good bokeh.  too bad you didn''t burn in the highlights on the side of the bee--that really takes away from an otherwise incredible capture.  i really love the organization of the image.  it gives you the feeling of the bee, floating from one island to another.  great work, good luck!</td>', 'oh, how i like this.  good bokeh.  too bad you didn''t burn in the highlights on the side of the bee--that really takes away from an otherwise incredible capture.  i really love the organization of the image.  it gives you the feeling of the bee, floating from one island to another.  great work, good luck!', '2005-01-14 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108294, 134815, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  this would have done well in candid.  here, for me, the bokeh is a bit too busy, providing more of a distraction than an enhancement.  i like the colors, and the sparkles in her hat really bring a lot to the image.  good luck!</td>', 'nice capture.  this would have done well in candid.  here, for me, the bokeh is a bit too busy, providing more of a distraction than an enhancement.  i like the colors, and the sparkles in her hat really bring a lot to the image.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 22:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108299, 134604, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting image.  on one hand, i like it.  on the other, i don''t like whatever it is you did to achieve your bokeh.  it has a very "processed" feel to it.  even if you managed to do this in camera, it doesn''t feel right.  the composition is incredible, as are the colors.  good luck!</td>', 'this is an interesting image.  on one hand, i like it.  on the other, i don''t like whatever it is you did to achieve your bokeh.  it has a very "processed" feel to it.  even if you managed to do this in camera, it doesn''t feel right.  the composition is incredible, as are the colors.  good luck!', '2005-01-14 22:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108379, 133674, 26313, '<td valign="top">I love it! Great composition, excellent focus and DOF. Might be improved by cropping a little from the top, but then again, maybe not...</td>', 'I love it! Great composition, excellent focus and DOF. Might be improved by cropping a little from the top, but then again, maybe not...', '2005-01-14 23:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108382, 134758, 26313, '<td valign="top">Very cool... The geese look almost three dimensional. Nice and crisp.</td>', 'Very cool... The geese look almost three dimensional. Nice and crisp.', '2005-01-14 23:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108465, 134146, 24528, '<td valign="top">Boy that look good rite about now...Good luck</td>', 'Boy that look good rite about now...Good luck', '2005-01-15 00:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108510, 134767, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot but the bokeh is a fairly small part of it''s overall impression</td>', 'I like this image a lot but the bokeh is a fairly small part of it''s overall impression', '2005-01-15 01:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108625, 134609, 6104, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong but I think this is just shallow DOF</td>', 'I may be wrong but I think this is just shallow DOF', '2005-01-15 02:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108629, 133966, 6104, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or does it look like he has a gun in his mouth? :x</td>', 'Is it just me or does it look like he has a gun in his mouth? :x', '2005-01-15 02:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108630, 134459, 30712, '<td valign="top">A stunning shot of great simplicity</td>', 'A stunning shot of great simplicity', '2005-01-15 02:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108633, 134295, 6104, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty photograph :)</td>', 'This is a very pretty photograph :)', '2005-01-15 02:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108645, 134794, 30712, '<td valign="top">A glass with class.</td>', 'A glass with class.', '2005-01-15 03:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108647, 133891, 30712, '<td valign="top">A shape that captures one''s interest.</td>', 'A shape that captures one''s interest.', '2005-01-15 03:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108648, 134650, 30712, '<td valign="top">A superb advertizing image.</td>', 'A superb advertizing image.', '2005-01-15 03:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108656, 134352, 23458, '<td valign="top">The lighting here seems a little harsh - there''s something about wildlife shots where a flash was obviously used that turns me off. The image is crisp though, and no Aussie can so no to a Kookaburra.</td>', 'The lighting here seems a little harsh - there''s something about wildlife shots where a flash was obviously used that turns me off. The image is crisp though, and no Aussie can so no to a Kookaburra.', '2005-01-15 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108658, 134675, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well this is clearly not a stopped motion shot (if you managed to pull that off a ten would not come close to rewarding your skill) but even still - I Have no idea how you managed to do this (scrabble tiles don''t exactly have anything to attach a thread to). Inventive and aesthetically pleasing. 9.</td>', 'Well this is clearly not a stopped motion shot (if you managed to pull that off a ten would not come close to rewarding your skill) but even still - I Have no idea how you managed to do this (scrabble tiles don''t exactly have anything to attach a thread to). Inventive and aesthetically pleasing. 9.', '2005-01-15 03:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108660, 134726, 30712, '<td valign="top">The background adds so much to this sharp appealing image.</td>', 'The background adds so much to this sharp appealing image.', '2005-01-15 03:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108663, 134334, 30712, '<td valign="top">The colours here make a really strking image - lovely</td>', 'The colours here make a really strking image - lovely', '2005-01-15 03:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108665, 134491, 30712, '<td valign="top">The background really adds to the whole image.  I like the little touches of blue on the plant itself.</td>', 'The background really adds to the whole image.  I like the little touches of blue on the plant itself.', '2005-01-15 03:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108666, 134704, 30712, '<td valign="top">Well composed.</td>', 'Well composed.', '2005-01-15 03:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108684, 134770, 26526, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph. Meets the bokeh callenge IMO. Love the colors and smooth background out of focus. Great detail, texture, showing on the cat''s fur.  Very well done!</td>', 'I really like this photograph. Meets the bokeh callenge IMO. Love the colors and smooth background out of focus. Great detail, texture, showing on the cat''s fur.  Very well done!', '2005-01-15 04:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108689, 134671, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great photograph! I like the bokeh you used, the out of focus gray background, the only color in the detailed orange leaves. Very well done!</td>', 'Great photograph! I like the bokeh you used, the out of focus gray background, the only color in the detailed orange leaves. Very well done!', '2005-01-15 04:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108690, 134404, 26526, '<td valign="top">Superb use of bokeh. Stunning color use.</td>', 'Superb use of bokeh. Stunning color use.', '2005-01-15 04:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108694, 134381, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like your use of bokeh. Great color.  Especially like the focus on the melting snow, knowing how tricky snow is to shoot, and keep it white. If I could get a snow shot half way this good, I would be happy. Very well done!</td>', 'Like your use of bokeh. Great color.  Especially like the focus on the melting snow, knowing how tricky snow is to shoot, and keep it white. If I could get a snow shot half way this good, I would be happy. Very well done!', '2005-01-15 04:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108695, 134283, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great use of bokeh in this photograph. The smooth out of focus background draws the eye immediately to the flower.  Stunning use of subdued color. I really like this photograph.</td>', 'Great use of bokeh in this photograph. The smooth out of focus background draws the eye immediately to the flower.  Stunning use of subdued color. I really like this photograph.', '2005-01-15 04:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108696, 134588, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great use of bokeh and color in this photograph. Wish I knew how you captured this shot.</td>', 'Great use of bokeh and color in this photograph. Wish I knew how you captured this shot.', '2005-01-15 04:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108699, 134775, 26526, '<td valign="top">Bokeh like I like to see it used in photographs! Eye drawn to the bee. Great composition. Wonderful use of color. Very well done!</td>', 'Bokeh like I like to see it used in photographs! Eye drawn to the bee. Great composition. Wonderful use of color. Very well done!', '2005-01-15 05:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108734, 134588, 25024, '<td valign="top">Great image - fits the challenge well. I love the effect of the glass and the colours - well done. 10</td>', 'Great image - fits the challenge well. I love the effect of the glass and the colours - well done. 10', '2005-01-15 07:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108735, 134675, 25024, '<td valign="top">Original with good lighting. I thought you had used a glass sheet but now I am not sure - I look forward to seeing how you done this - well done</td>', 'Original with good lighting. I thought you had used a glass sheet but now I am not sure - I look forward to seeing how you done this - well done', '2005-01-15 07:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1108737, 134771, 25024, '<td valign="top">very powerful image and excellent execution (oops).</td>', 'very powerful image and excellent execution (oops).', '2005-01-15 07:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
