(1112422, 134514, 23394, '<td valign="top">i admire your effort here, but feel that the concept has fallen short in the execution.  whether or not you met the challenge is not in question as much as whether or not you have delivered a competitive entry.  my basic benchmark for this is whether or not the image would either look good on a wall or grab my attention if i found it in a magazine.  for my taste, this would do neither.</td>', 'i admire your effort here, but feel that the concept has fallen short in the execution.  whether or not you met the challenge is not in question as much as whether or not you have delivered a competitive entry.  my basic benchmark for this is whether or not the image would either look good on a wall or grab my attention if i found it in a magazine.  for my taste, this would do neither.', '2005-01-16 18:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
