(1112519, 134588, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is by far my favourite shot of the series.  I love the effect caused by the bulbs glass: truly interesting.  The choice of a square crop with your subject centered is also very good.  I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t get a top-3 placing.</td>', 'This is by far my favourite shot of the series.  I love the effect caused by the bulbs glass: truly interesting.  The choice of a square crop with your subject centered is also very good.  I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t get a top-3 placing.', '2005-01-16 19:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112522, 134775, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  This is the last thing I would have thought seing being that we are in the middle of winter in North America.  Very well done and among my favourites.  The only flaw (minimal) for me is that the highlights on the bee are a bit blown out.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  This is the last thing I would have thought seing being that we are in the middle of winter in North America.  Very well done and among my favourites.  The only flaw (minimal) for me is that the highlights on the bee are a bit blown out.  Good luck.', '2005-01-16 19:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112526, 134646, 11738, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the bubble.  I would have liked to see a few more nails in the foreground in focus.  Your background makes for a very interesting image also.</td>', 'Great focus on the bubble.  I would have liked to see a few more nails in the foreground in focus.  Your background makes for a very interesting image also.', '2005-01-16 19:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112532, 134295, 11738, '<td valign="top">I love the tone on this one.  I laso like that you focussed on the central part of the branch rather than on the tips.  I also like how the background goes from light in the lower-right corner to dark in the upper-left corner.  One of my favourites for the challenge.</td>', 'I love the tone on this one.  I laso like that you focussed on the central part of the branch rather than on the tips.  I also like how the background goes from light in the lower-right corner to dark in the upper-left corner.  One of my favourites for the challenge.', '2005-01-16 19:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112535, 134632, 11738, '<td valign="top">Love the expression of the guy in the background: "Why I oughta...!"  Not quite bokeh in my book, but I really enjoy the image anyway.</td>', 'Love the expression of the guy in the background: "Why I oughta...!"  Not quite bokeh in my book, but I really enjoy the image anyway.', '2005-01-16 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112602, 134334, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent capture.  these tones are exquisite.  i hope you other shots from this shooting that you can share, because opportunities like this rarely repeat themselves.  hope this does well for you in the challenge.</td>', 'excellent capture.  these tones are exquisite.  i hope you other shots from this shooting that you can share, because opportunities like this rarely repeat themselves.  hope this does well for you in the challenge.', '2005-01-16 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112603, 133623, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you have met the challenge, but i''m afraid, though, that your subject is less than compelling.  it is pretty, and it does make me feel cold looking at it, but visually, it''s not really doing to much to move me.</td>', 'yes, you have met the challenge, but i''m afraid, though, that your subject is less than compelling.  it is pretty, and it does make me feel cold looking at it, but visually, it''s not really doing to much to move me.', '2005-01-16 19:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112607, 133779, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you have basically met the challenge, but, all the same, your subject is pretty much lost in all the details.  other than making me feel cold, your image is not really moving me.</td>', 'ok, you have basically met the challenge, but, all the same, your subject is pretty much lost in all the details.  other than making me feel cold, your image is not really moving me.', '2005-01-16 19:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112624, 134688, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, you have achieved a bokeh effect, but it is not really contributing to your subject.  here, your subject so overwhelmingly dominates the image that there is very little for the background to do, other than to just be there.  perhaps a different angle and/or perspective could have made more use of the lovely tones in the fallen leaves.</td>', 'yes, you have achieved a bokeh effect, but it is not really contributing to your subject.  here, your subject so overwhelmingly dominates the image that there is very little for the background to do, other than to just be there.  perhaps a different angle and/or perspective could have made more use of the lovely tones in the fallen leaves.', '2005-01-16 19:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112637, 134784, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, i''m sorry if this comes across harsh, because i usually try to be as tactful as possible, but this image is really testing me.  come on!  yes, you have a blurred background, but other than the rain drops on the windshielf, it''s all blurry.  there is no subject!  i can tell that you have a semi-decent camera and that you are using some type of post-processing software.  you could have found just about anything to take a picture of that could have made use of this grayed out background other than shooting through the windshield.  save shots like this for your portfolio, not for challenges, where the purpose is to grab the voter''s attention and engage their imagination with your image, not to make them scratch their heads and wonder why you submitted what you did.  all i can say here is better luck next time.  (and if you don''t think i know what i''m talking about, look at my lucky seven entry!)</td>', 'ok, i''m sorry if this comes across harsh, because i usually try to be as tactful as possible, but this image is really testing me.  come on!  yes, you have a blurred background, but other than the rain drops on the windshielf, it''s all blurry.  there is no subject!  i can tell that you have a semi-decent camera and that you are using some type of post-processing software.  you could have found just about anything to take a picture of that could have made use of this grayed out background other than shooting through the windshield.  save shots like this for your portfolio, not for challenges, where the purpose is to grab the voter''s attention and engage their imagination with your image, not to make them scratch their heads and wonder why you submitted what you did.  all i can say here is better luck next time.  (and if you don''t think i know what i''m talking about, look at my lucky seven entry!)', '2005-01-16 20:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112691, 134609, 25742, '<td valign="top">finally some humour in this rather dry challenge.</td>', 'finally some humour in this rather dry challenge.', '2005-01-16 20:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112718, 134245, 17507, '<td valign="top">the white lights make the picture. great bokeh (which is not something I can say for more than about 1 in 10 images). 8</td>', 'the white lights make the picture. great bokeh (which is not something I can say for more than about 1 in 10 images). 8', '2005-01-16 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112720, 133564, 17507, '<td valign="top">Titles are important to images; they can make it or break it. here I''m bothered by the fact that it''s actually spelled "queue" :P</td>', 'Titles are important to images; they can make it or break it. here I''m bothered by the fact that it''s actually spelled "queue" :P', '2005-01-16 20:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112721, 134605, 31708, '<td valign="top">I really like this Photo, The Chess Piece is definately enhanced by the background</td>', 'I really like this Photo, The Chess Piece is definately enhanced by the background', '2005-01-16 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112722, 134570, 17507, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the relationship between the bottle and the background. For this challenge there really should be a strong relationship.</td>', 'Don''t get the relationship between the bottle and the background. For this challenge there really should be a strong relationship.', '2005-01-16 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112727, 134675, 31708, '<td valign="top">Very Creative,I like this alot.</td>', 'Very Creative,I like this alot.', '2005-01-16 20:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112729, 134216, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hm... new improved strawberries with a higher iron content than ever!</td>', 'Hm... new improved strawberries with a higher iron content than ever!', '2005-01-16 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112730, 134682, 17507, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting submissions. Since the subjects are so flat (being books) I think that more dramatic lighting would have helped a lot. Interesting juxtaposition, and good title.</td>', 'One of the more interesting submissions. Since the subjects are so flat (being books) I think that more dramatic lighting would have helped a lot. Interesting juxtaposition, and good title.', '2005-01-16 20:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112734, 134667, 17507, '<td valign="top">Background white is very strong- painful to look at. I like the droplets on the tips of the needles, tho.</td>', 'Background white is very strong- painful to look at. I like the droplets on the tips of the needles, tho.', '2005-01-16 20:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112736, 133272, 17507, '<td valign="top">Bokeh is almost overwhelming! If it were possible to tone down the droplets, I think it would have helped a bit.</td>', 'Bokeh is almost overwhelming! If it were possible to tone down the droplets, I think it would have helped a bit.', '2005-01-16 20:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112741, 134577, 17507, '<td valign="top">Things I notice about this picture.<br/>1. Bright colors. Wow, those mugs are not what you want to see the morning after a lot of heavy drinking.<br/>2. Reminds me a lot of ... oh what was it called, "A Splash of Color," I think, that won a blue ribbon a while back.<br/>3. That is the fullest cup of coffee I have ever seen.<br/> <br/>This entry definitely stands out from the rest. Compositionally I find myself wishing that the coffee drops were closer to the 1/3 mark to activate more of the image space.</td>', 'Things I notice about this picture.1. Bright colors. Wow, those mugs are not what you want to see the morning after a lot of heavy drinking.2. Reminds me a lot of ... oh what was it called, "A Splash of Color," I think, that won a blue ribbon a while back.3. That is the fullest cup of coffee I have ever seen. This entry definitely stands out from the rest. Compositionally I find myself wishing that the coffee drops were closer to the 1/3 mark to activate more of the image space.', '2005-01-16 20:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112797, 133731, 25742, '<td valign="top">Nice how the lights complement the outlines of the figure. Good work.</td>', 'Nice how the lights complement the outlines of the figure. Good work.', '2005-01-16 21:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112798, 134083, 25742, '<td valign="top">Citizen Kane :)</td>', 'Citizen Kane :)', '2005-01-16 21:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112826, 134802, 25742, '<td valign="top">make my eyes hurt. good idea though. good luck</td>', 'make my eyes hurt. good idea though. good luck', '2005-01-16 21:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112835, 134283, 31559, '<td valign="top">Absolutly beautifull, have my ten</td>', 'Absolutly beautifull, have my ten', '2005-01-16 21:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1112837, 134590, 17507, '<td valign="top">it''s a bokeh of roses &gt;_&lt;<br/> <br/>unfortunately this doesn''t seem to meet the challenge, other than in this tangential punny way. the background is completely flat and adds nothing to the image.</td>', 'it''s a bokeh of roses >_< unfortunately this doesn''t seem to meet the challenge, other than in this tangential punny way. the background is completely flat and adds nothing to the image.', '2005-01-16 21:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
