(1113975, 134704, 11738, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!  Thanks for all the votes and comments folks. <br/> <br/>I was on pins and needles about this one all week.  The score kept fluctuatiing back and forth, back and forth.  I knew it was doing well and that it had a chance at the top-3, but I was sure other images were going to do better ribbon-wise.  Glad to see that I was wrong!<br/> <br/>Nova: Lens used was my Canon 300mm f4 IS.  This badboy is a joy to work with!  I was completely taken aback when I saw that I captured this at 1/100.  These little guys hardly sit still.<br/> <br/>Here is the original image:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=137342" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/11738/thumb/137342.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/11738/thumb/137342.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/11738/thumb/137342.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>As you can see, I did some <b>serious</b> cropping.  Even with all that cropping, the image quality was still very high.  A testament to lense''s quality.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Woohoo!  Thanks for all the votes and comments folks.  I was on pins and needles about this one all week.  The score kept fluctuatiing back and forth, back and forth.  I knew it was doing well and that it had a chance at the top-3, but I was sure other images were going to do better ribbon-wise.  Glad to see that I was wrong! Nova: Lens used was my Canon 300mm f4 IS.  This badboy is a joy to work with!  I was completely taken aback when I saw that I captured this at 1/100.  These little guys hardly sit still. Here is the original image:  As you can see, I did some serious cropping.  Even with all that cropping, the image quality was still very high.  A testament to lense''s quality. Thanks again!', '2005-01-17 08:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1113993, 134588, 11738, '<td valign="top">Way to go Owen!  And way to go us.  First and second place go to the Atlantic Canada boys! <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/rock.gif'', strrpos(''//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/rock.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.hawkins.nu/gtchat/images/rock.gif"/> <br/> <br/>I had this as my blue ribbon choice for this challenge.  I was sure you were taking first.  A truly awesome shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-17 08:28:28.</i></td>', 'Way to go Owen!  And way to go us.  First and second place go to the Atlantic Canada boys!   I had this as my blue ribbon choice for this challenge.  I was sure you were taking first.  A truly awesome shot.', '2005-01-17 08:27:59.000000', '2005-01-17 08:28:28.000000', 0),
(1114009, 133964, 16148, '<td valign="top">This is a nice surprise!  So many great shots in this challenge.  Thanks for all the high scores and encouraging comments.  This is my highest rated entry yet.  I''ve had quite a week with a 4th in Where is Waldo and my second ribbon for Bokeh.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-01-09 22:06:47.</i></td>', 'This is a nice surprise!  So many great shots in this challenge.  Thanks for all the high scores and encouraging comments.  This is my highest rated entry yet.  I''ve had quite a week with a 4th in Where is Waldo and my second ribbon for Bokeh.', '2005-01-17 08:35:43.000000', '2011-01-09 22:06:47.000000', 0),
(1114011, 134704, 4285, '<td valign="top">Let''s hear it for the East Coast. ;) Amazing detail for such a tight crop. Thanks for posting your setup and original. Great stuff. When''s the Atlantic Canada GTG?<br/> <br/>edit: This was one of my top votes.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-17 08:39:35.</i></td>', 'Let''s hear it for the East Coast. ;) Amazing detail for such a tight crop. Thanks for posting your setup and original. Great stuff. When''s the Atlantic Canada GTG? edit: This was one of my top votes.', '2005-01-17 08:36:50.000000', '2005-01-17 08:39:35.000000', 0),
(1114019, 134588, 16148, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  A very intense bokeh that enhances your subject.  Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-17 11:59:05.</i></td>', 'Congratulations!  A very intense bokeh that enhances your subject.  Well done.', '2005-01-17 08:45:09.000000', '2005-01-17 11:59:05.000000', 0),
(1114026, 134704, 16148, '<td valign="top">A solid composition and nice use of bokeh.  Congratulations on your blue.</td>', 'A solid composition and nice use of bokeh.  Congratulations on your blue.', '2005-01-17 08:47:09.000000', NULL, 0),
