(1114551, 134808, 7889, '<td valign="top">This was my fav of the challenge but I am at a loss why this did not finish in the top 5. Great shot Martin<br/> <br/>What lens did you use??<br/> <br/>Mike<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-17 13:03:09.</i></td>', 'This was my fav of the challenge but I am at a loss why this did not finish in the top 5. Great shot Martin What lens did you use?? Mike', '2005-01-17 13:02:22.000000', '2005-01-17 13:03:09.000000', 0),
(1114629, 134604, 24674, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for all the nice comments. It is really encouraging to get a 6+ score. <br/> <br/>The lines in the bokeh are mostly because I shot this through a diamond shaped wire fence. I hadn''t realised this until a few days after I submitted this photo. Also, I think this is a bit hard to reproduce even since other photos taken through the fence don''t have this design. But I do intend to experiment some more with extreme fg blurring for a subtle effect.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for all the nice comments. It is really encouraging to get a 6+ score.  The lines in the bokeh are mostly because I shot this through a diamond shaped wire fence. I hadn''t realised this until a few days after I submitted this photo. Also, I think this is a bit hard to reproduce even since other photos taken through the fence don''t have this design. But I do intend to experiment some more with extreme fg blurring for a subtle effect. Thanks again.', '2005-01-17 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114680, 133746, 93, '<td valign="top">Yah. One of my better photographs as far as "technical" goes.. but it certainly wasn''t very good for the challenge..<br/> <br/>Whattya gonna do.<br/> <br/>I''m too far ahead of my time I think.  A genius in an age of mediocrity.<br/> <br/>That''s it.</td>', 'Yah. One of my better photographs as far as "technical" goes.. but it certainly wasn''t very good for the challenge.. Whattya gonna do. I''m too far ahead of my time I think.  A genius in an age of mediocrity. That''s it.', '2005-01-17 13:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114701, 134704, 11895, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well deserved blue, beautiful shot.</td>', 'Congrats on a well deserved blue, beautiful shot.', '2005-01-17 13:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114779, 134704, 255, '<td valign="top">good grief, i can''t get over how freakin cute that bird is...i just want to sqeeze it! but since i can''t, i guess i''ll just have to fave it--cause everytime i see it, it makes me smile. :)<br/> <br/>congrats on another blue--i bet jacques is starting to get a little worried! ;)</td>', 'good grief, i can''t get over how freakin cute that bird is...i just want to sqeeze it! but since i can''t, i guess i''ll just have to fave it--cause everytime i see it, it makes me smile. :) congrats on another blue--i bet jacques is starting to get a little worried! ;)', '2005-01-17 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114838, 133090, 31327, '<td valign="top">I''ve read some of the comments, and I fear I disagree about blurring the subject, mostly because the wire fence creates a lot of strong lines that lead the eye around and out of the photo. The splotch of blurred color doesn''t have enough power to grab the viewer''s attention. It needs detail to make it interesting, and you can''t have detail when the subject is out of focus.<br/> <br/>Desaturating the green may make the flower stand out better, but it still can''t compete with the fence. I would have liked the suggestion of the fence (blurred) and the detail of the bloom.<br/> <br/>Just my opinion, of course.</td>', 'I''ve read some of the comments, and I fear I disagree about blurring the subject, mostly because the wire fence creates a lot of strong lines that lead the eye around and out of the photo. The splotch of blurred color doesn''t have enough power to grab the viewer''s attention. It needs detail to make it interesting, and you can''t have detail when the subject is out of focus. Desaturating the green may make the flower stand out better, but it still can''t compete with the fence. I would have liked the suggestion of the fence (blurred) and the detail of the bloom. Just my opinion, of course.', '2005-01-17 15:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114857, 134588, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is really cool! Congratulations on  your ribbon!</td>', 'This is really cool! Congratulations on  your ribbon!', '2005-01-17 15:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114859, 134704, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is so charming! Bokeh gives this a magical tone and mood.</td>', 'This is so charming! Bokeh gives this a magical tone and mood.', '2005-01-17 15:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1114860, 133964, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely work, Henry! Congratulations on the ribbon!</td>', 'Very lovely work, Henry! Congratulations on the ribbon!', '2005-01-17 15:17:33.000000', NULL, 0),
