(1115169, 134485, 7291, '<td valign="top">Sheesh.  You just never know with these DPC voters. It''s good to know that there were 2 others that agreed with me in giving this a 10.</td>', 'Sheesh.  You just never know with these DPC voters. It''s good to know that there were 2 others that agreed with me in giving this a 10.', '2005-01-17 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
