(1116785, 134635, 21862, '<td valign="top">You know,  I like this one, but I''m thinking that for the sake of the competition, a more dramatic results might have been something similar to the picture I showed you earlier, with SO MUCH of the face out of focus.  I''m sure it would be difficult to do, but I''m also convinced you can do this.  Additionally, I think some backlighting also would have helped the subject by giving more information about the "bokeh".</td>', 'You know,  I like this one, but I''m thinking that for the sake of the competition, a more dramatic results might have been something similar to the picture I showed you earlier, with SO MUCH of the face out of focus.  I''m sure it would be difficult to do, but I''m also convinced you can do this.  Additionally, I think some backlighting also would have helped the subject by giving more information about the "bokeh".', '2005-01-18 12:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
