(1139667, 134472, 5286, '<td valign="top">The bokeh and the colors are beautiful!! Compositionally, I think having more space around the rose would bring out the flower a lot more. Also, the lower part of the image doesn''t really add so much, most of the action is in the upper part. A horizontal shot rather than a vertical one would probably serve both purposes at once..</td>', 'The bokeh and the colors are beautiful!! Compositionally, I think having more space around the rose would bring out the flower a lot more. Also, the lower part of the image doesn''t really add so much, most of the action is in the upper part. A horizontal shot rather than a vertical one would probably serve both purposes at once..', '2005-01-30 00:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
