(1481832, 134570, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a great "product" shot!  (I''ll admit, quietly, to being one of the people who gave you a five.  I don''t remember why...bad mood, New York in January, jealousy?)  Bokeh was a brutal challenge!  It''s a word I''ll never forget and, probably, never fully understand.<br/> <br/>You do have crispness and color on your side in this image.  I wish my "5" was so "terrible" as this....it would have been better. =)<br/> <br/>Thanks for playing!</td>', 'This is a great "product" shot!  (I''ll admit, quietly, to being one of the people who gave you a five.  I don''t remember why...bad mood, New York in January, jealousy?)  Bokeh was a brutal challenge!  It''s a word I''ll never forget and, probably, never fully understand. You do have crispness and color on your side in this image.  I wish my "5" was so "terrible" as this....it would have been better. =) Thanks for playing!', '2005-06-24 18:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
